\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e→ Mondragon 2\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.framer.com/marketplace/templates/mondragon-3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e→ Mondragon 3\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.framer.com/marketplace/templates/mondragon-4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e→ Mondragon 4\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.framer.com/marketplace/templates/mondragon-5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e→ Mondragon 5\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.framer.com/marketplace/templates/mondragon-6/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e→ Mondragon 6\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.framer.com/marketplace/templates/mondragon-7/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e→ Mondragon 7\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_UKc7OvMhp078nRrgTKQYfW4LYTvH01wc6CnuW2BNuUg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e➤︎ Buy All Mondragon Templates for $99\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eAbout Author\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eHi, my name is Sabit (Sabo). I bring over 20 years of hands-on experience in web design, backed by a deep background in web development. For me, design is about anticipating what comes next. I rely on my intuition for emerging trends and a relentless focus on aesthetics to craft digital experiences that feel fresh, bold, and ahead of the curve. Mondragon is a reflection of that vision.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eMondragon Best for:\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDigital Agency\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreative Agency\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMarketing Agency\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWeb design Agency\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePortfolio Website\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBranding Agency\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesign Studio\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreative Studio\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesign Studio\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePortfolio\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePersonal Brand\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFreelancer / Consulting\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStartup\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesign Consulting\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesign Agency\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWeb Agency\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWeb Development\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePortfolio Agency\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDigital Studio\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e50:T6d4,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://fuel.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eLive Preview\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://x.com/framer/status/2032142055376633937?s=20\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTemplate of the Year 2025 — Framer Awards\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFuel is a remarkable premium agency \u0026amp; portfolio template crafted to enhance your portfolio\u0026#39;s or agency\u0026#39;s presentation. It’s an ideal portfolio solution for designers, freelancers, creative agencies, digital agencies, photographers, or anyone in the creative industry who wants to showcase their portfolio or agency\u0026#39;s in a clean and sophisticated way. The minimal design keeps the focus entirely on your portfolio or agency, allowing the work to speak for itself.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you\u0026#39;re building your first portfolio or looking to refresh your existing one, Fuel offers the perfect balance of simplicity and elegance. Its portfolio-centric layout ensures that every project in your portfolio or agency stands out, free from unnecessary clutter. This template is designed for professionals who value the importance of a well-curated portfolio and agency, helping to make a lasting impression on clients and employers. If you\u0026#39;re looking for a powerful and stylish way to present your portfolio or agency, Fuel is the ideal choice to take your portfolio or agency to the next level.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor anyone serious about their portfolio, Fuel provides everything needed to create a striking portfolio or agency\u0026#39;s that commands attention.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNeed help or have a question? Feel free to reach out at \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"mailto:westhillstudio77@gmail.com\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ewesthillstudio77@gmail.com\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e51:Tc39,\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"clapper\"\u003e🎬\u003c/span\u003e DreamMotion – AI Image \u0026amp; Video Generator Framer Template\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eDreamMotion is a premium \u003cstrong\u003eFramer template\u003c/strong\u003e built for \u003cstrong\u003eAI image generators, AI video generators, AI photo editors, AI creative tools, and modern SaaS startups\u003c/strong\u003e. Whether you\u0026#39;re launching a \u003cstrong\u003eText-to-Image, Image-to-Video, AI Art Generator, AI Avatar Generator, AI Design Tool, or any creative AI product\u003c/strong\u003e, DreamMotion helps you build a beautiful, high-converting landing page without coding.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eUnlike generic SaaS templates, DreamMotion is designed specifically for \u003cstrong\u003evisual AI products\u003c/strong\u003e. It combines cinematic layouts, premium gradients, smooth animations, and conversion-focused sections to showcase AI-generated images and videos in the best possible way while driving more signups.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eInspired by today\u0026#39;s leading AI products, every section is fully responsive, SEO-friendly, performance optimized, and easy to customize in Framer, making it the perfect choice for founders, startups, agencies, and indie hackers launching their next AI product.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"sparkles\"\u003e✨\u003c/span\u003e Includes\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePremium Hero\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct Showcase\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFeature Sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBento Grid\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI Workflow\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eImage \u0026amp; Video Gallery\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDemo Section\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePricing\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTestimonials\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFAQs\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCTA Sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProfessional Footer\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eResponsive Design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSmooth Animations\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSEO Optimized\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt 100% in Framer\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy Customization\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo Code Required\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan dat