setup.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you\u0026#39;re a designer, agency or creative studio, this website template gives you the tools to build a site that truly represents your brand.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePAGES INCLUDED\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHome\u003c/strong\u003e – A structured, conversion-optimized landing page.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProjects (CMS)\u003c/strong\u003e – A clean, professional way to showcase your work.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStudio \u0026amp; About\u003c/strong\u003e – Tell your story with confidence.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBlog (CMS)\u003c/strong\u003e – A flexible layout for sharing insights.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContact \u0026amp; Legal Pages (CMS)\u003c/strong\u003e – Everything you need for a polished, complete website.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/50744-fabrica-3srDwRONUuB39gvDd1fLzR1CxB8zwJ\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch3\u003eChangelog\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1.0\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInitial release.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1.01\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAccordion component updated to the latest version.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1.02\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eVideo player added to the projects page.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1.03\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eImproved sorting and search functionality on \u0026quot;Projects\u0026quot; page, adding support for customizing fields directly on the canvas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1.04\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUpgraded and optimized the video background component.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1.05\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFixed Safari 26 Hero animation bug.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1.06\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eImplemented new \u0026quot;Fit image\u0026quot; feature on the projects page to replace the external image component.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1.07\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOptimized animations for better performance on Chrome based browsers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eReplaced Smooth Scroll component with Lenis from darkroom.engineering.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1.1\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNew Feature:\u003c/strong\u003e Integrated \u003cstrong\u003eNative CMS Filtering\u003c/strong\u003e. Easily sort and filter your content collections without third-party plugins or complex custom code.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eContacts\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eQuestions? Reach out via \u003ca href=\"https://x.com/bynneh\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ex.com\u003c/a\u003e or email \u003ca href=\"mailto:hello@templifica.com\"\u003ehello@templifica.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e53:Tbc3,\u003cfigure data-youtube-url=\"https://youtu.be/B3-qJYb_d08\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/B3-qJYb_d08?color=white\u0026amp;autoplay=0\u0026amp;controls=1\u0026amp;rel=0\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" width=\"700\" height=\"395\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003eCreate® — Teaser\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch2\u003eCreate® is a premium, agency-grade template built for creators, creative teams, and agencies who want a site that looks as professional as the work behind it and delivers real results.\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eInfluenced by Swiss design principles, it blends clean typography with clear visual rhythm—creating balance and a timeless look that elevates your work and builds trust.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith modular sections, smart structure, and intuitive controls, you can \u003cstrong\u003elaunch your site in days, not weeks.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eStep-by-Step Video Tutorials\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eShort videos guide you through the sections of the template — plus practical tips for settings and optimization.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure data-youtube-url=\"https://youtu.be/CHh0hiET0Vk\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CHh0hiET0Vk?color=white\u0026amp;autoplay=0\u0026amp;controls=1\u0026amp;rel=0\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" width=\"700\" height=\"395\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003eIntro to short video tutorial series\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch2\u003eGoing further — Extended Pro\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSelect Extended Pro at \u003ca href=\"https://dub.sh/create-extendedpro\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003echeckout \u003c/a\u003efor:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUnlimited Domains\u003c/strong\u003e — Use the template across multiple client or personal projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFigma Source File\u003c/strong\u003e — A fully layered, production-ready replica of the template.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePremium Lifetime Support\u003c/strong\u003e — No chatbot. No ticket queue. No automated replies. Questions go directly to Tamas, the designer behind Create®.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_PIPVsPf0AlqLTO6DasVPQ4KHibQXi8dRvU2TD0RkeYS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eAll-Access for $299\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eGet instant access to every Framer template I’ve created with Extended Pro license including: \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNubo (NEW), Spector, Vertical, Create\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"registered\"\u003e®\u003c/span\u003e, Platform, Arpeggio, Rescale and Rebirth.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe current template value is \u003cstrong\u003eover $1000\u003c/strong\u003e (with Extended Pro license including Figma files)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat’s included:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRemix links for all current templates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFigma source files for all templates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUnlimited domain usage (reuse on multiple domains)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e50% discount for all future templates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLifetime Update \u0026amp; Priority Support\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e54:Tb4d,\u003cp\u003eCreatie\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"registered\"\u003e®\u003c/span\u003e | Playful Creative Designer Portfolio Framer Template\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eStand out with \u003cstrong\u003eCreatie\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"registered\"\u003e®\u003c/span\u003e, a vibrant and interactive \u003cstrong\u003eCreative Portfolio Framer Template\u003c/strong\u003e crafted for UI/UX designers, graphic designers, freelancers, creative developers, illustrators, photographers, motion designers, and digital creatives. Combining bold typography, playful graphics, draggable elements, engaging animations, and immersive interactions, Creatie\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"registered\"\u003e®\u003c/span\u003e helps you build a memorable portfolio that showcases your work and personality while leaving a lasting impression.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"sparkles\"\u003e✨\u003c/span\u003e Perfect For\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e• UI/UX Designers • Graphic Designers • Creative Developers • Motion Designers • Illustrators • Photographers • Freelancers • Digital Creatives • Personal Portfolio Websites\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"rocket\"\u003e🚀\u003c/span\u003e Includes\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Bold Hero Section • About Section with Statistics • Featured Projects Showcase • Interactive Project Overlays • Services Section • Client Reviews • FAQ Section • Contact Form • Beautiful Footer CTA • Fully Responsive Design • Tablet \u0026amp; Mobile Optimized • Smooth Framer Animations • Draggable Graphic Elements • Eye-Following Cursor Effect • Background Graphics • Vibrant Visual Style • Reusable Components • Color Variables • Text Variables • Well-Organized Layers • Easy Customization • SEO Friendly Structure\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"art\"\u003e🎨\u003c/span\u003e Why Choose Creatie?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Modern playful aesthetic • Premium portfolio experience • Fast and lightweight • Clean, organized structure • Beginner-friendly customization • Built entirely in Framer • Designed to impress clients and recruiters\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"link\"\u003e🔗\u003c/span\u003e Preview\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLive Preview:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://creatiie.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://creatiie.framer.website/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"envelope_with_arrow\"\u003e📩\u003c/span\u003e Support\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eNeed help or have questions?\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEmail:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"mailto:contact@firstframe.agency\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003econtact@firstframe.agency\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThank you for choosing \u003cstrong\u003eCreatie\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"registered\"\u003e®\u003c/span\u003e. We can\u0026#39;t wait to see what you build! \u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLicense\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eValid for \u003cstrong\u003eone or more personal, commercial, or client website\u003c/strong\u003e. You may customize the template for your own projects, but you may \u003cstrong\u003enot\u003c/strong\u003e resell, redistribute, share, or repackage the template, modified or unmodified.\u003c/p\u003e55:T753,\u003cp\u003eIntroducing \u003cstrong\u003eKirk \u003c/strong\u003e- a colorful, eccentric, and unapologetically bold Framer template built for creators who refuse to blend in. Forget safe, predictable portfolios—Kirk is loud, expressive, and designed to make an immediate impression. Every color, composition, and interaction is crafted to inject personality into your work and turn every project into a statement.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhere others embrace restraint, Kirk celebrates character. Its vibrant visual language, playful energy, and fearless design choices create an experience that feels alive, memorable, and impossible to ignore. This is a template that doesn't whisper for attention—it owns the room.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith immersive layouts, dynamic pacing, and a strong editorial sensibility, Kirk transforms portfolios into experiences full of impact and individuality. Whether you're a designer, creative studio, artist, or innovator, it gives your work the stage it deserves: colorful, eccentric, and packed with presence.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMore than a template, Kirk is an attitude. A celebration of creativity without compromise. Built for those who believe great work deserves great personality—and that boring portfolios are officially over.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/65551-kirk-Pq96XhxVu1o9q0IVgCJK8SAFiAKrfP\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eColorful \u0026amp; Eccentric Visual Identity\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLoud, Unapologetic Design Language\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eImpactful Portfolio Presentations\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eImmersive, Personality-Driven Layouts\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDynamic Interactions \u0026amp; Motion\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt to Stand Out and Be Remembered\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned for Creative Storytelling\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eShow your work with Kirk—where bold ideas get the attention they deserve, and every pixel has something to say.\u003c/p\u003e56:Td44,\u003cfigure data-youtube-url=\"https://youtu.be/WSJT1C6iSsI\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WSJT1C6iSsI?color=white\u0026amp;autoplay=0\u0026amp;controls=1\u0026amp;rel=0\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" width=\"700\" height=\"395\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003eSpector Template Teaser\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp\u003eProcess. Systems. Recognition. Outcomes. Every section is built around how creative work is actually evaluated, so by the time a visitor reaches your contact page, they\u0026#39;ve already decided.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you\u0026#39;re a studio of fifteen or a practice of one, Spector gives the work somewhere to live — and somewhere to be taken seriously.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWho is it for\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eAgencies, studios, and independent creatives who treat their own site as a body of work. Branding, motion, product, and multidisciplinary teams building something they want to stand behind.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhat you get\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e11 responsive pages\u003c/strong\u003e, including CMS-driven Projects and Lab\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e13 custom code components \u003c/strong\u003ebuilt exclusively for Spector\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEditorial layouts \u003c/strong\u003edesigned for long-form case studies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3 ChatGPT, Claude super-prompts\u003c/strong\u003e for generating content and consistent imagery across Services and Process\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e25% off \u003c/strong\u003eFramer Pro yearly hosting plan\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGetting started guide\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLifetime email/video support \u003c/strong\u003efrom the creator\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRegular\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eupdates\u003c/strong\u003e, template improvements\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eContent Superprompts\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/55318-spector-OTlWMM7R1zxOCHLSwnbW9KkQVzt8lB\" alt=\"Content Superprompts\" /\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003eContent Superprompts\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch2\u003eGoing further — Extended Pro\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSelect Extended Pro at \u003ca href=\"https://dub.sh/spector-all\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003echeckout\u003c/a\u003e for:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUnlimited Domains\u003c/strong\u003e — Use the template across multiple client or personal projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFigma Source File\u003c/strong\u003e — A fully layered, production-ready replica of the template.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePremium Lifetime Support\u003c/strong\u003e — No chatbot. No ticket queue. Questions go directly to Tamas, the designer behind Spector.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_PIPVsPf0AlqLTO6DasVPQ4KHibQXi8dRvU2TD0RkeYS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eAll-Access for $299\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eGet instant access to every Framer template I’ve created with Extended Pro license including: \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNubo (NEW), Spector, Vertical, Create\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"registered\"\u003e®\u003c/span\u003e, Platform, Arpeggio, Rescale and Rebirth.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe current template value is \u003cstrong\u003eover $1000\u003c/strong\u003e (with Extended Pro license