c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- B2B SaaS \u0026amp; Cloud SaaS Marketing Landing\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Enterprise SaaS \u0026amp; Developer SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Web SaaS \u0026amp; Data SaaS Landing\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- CRM SaaS \u0026amp; Fintech SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Modern SaaS \u0026amp; Scalable SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Healthtech SaaS \u0026amp; Reporting SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Commerce SaaS \u0026amp; Billing SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Payments SaaS \u0026amp; Micro SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Vertical SaaS \u0026amp; Subscription SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- AI Workflow SaaS \u0026amp; Analytics SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Marketing SaaS \u0026amp; Growth SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Automation SaaS \u0026amp; Support SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Sales SaaS \u0026amp; Cloud SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- B2B SaaS \u0026amp; Developer SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Enterprise SaaS \u0026amp; Data SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Web SaaS \u0026amp; Fintech SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- CRM SaaS \u0026amp; Scalable SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Modern SaaS \u0026amp; Mobile SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Healthtech SaaS \u0026amp; Billing SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Commerce SaaS \u0026amp; Micro SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Payments SaaS \u0026amp; Subscription SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSAAS PAGES:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e3 SaaS Homepage Versions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e3 SaaS Pricing Pages\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSaaS Feature Page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlog \u0026amp; CMS\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAnd More...\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWHY STARTUPS CHOOSE SAALIX:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- AI-ready and fast\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- A landing page that converts\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Built for SaaS and B2B\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLaunch your SaaS startup landing page today — Saalix ships it.\u003c/p\u003e5c:T673,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://portfolite.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLive Preview\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePortfolite is an exceptional minimal portfolio \u0026amp; agency template meticulously designed to enhance your agency\u0026#39;s or portfolio\u0026#39;s presentation. It’s the ultimate portfolio solution for creative designers, freelancers, creative agencies, digital agencies, personal portfolios, minimal agencies, or anyone in the creative industry looking to showcase their portfolio or agency with sophistication and style. The minimalist design keeps the spotlight on your agency\u0026#39;s or portfolio\u0026#39;s aesthetics, ensuring your work shines through effortlessly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you’re building your first portfolio/agency, redesigning your existing agency, or looking to create a modern portfolio, Portfolite provides the ideal balance of elegance and functionality. Its portfolio-centric and agency-focused layout highlights every project in your portfolio or agency without unnecessary distractions. Designed for professionals who value a refined portfolio and agency presentation, this template helps leave a lasting impression on clients and employers alike. Portfolite is the go-to choice for anyone looking to elevate their portfolio or agency to new heights.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor professionals serious about their portfolio or agency, Portfolite offers all the tools needed to create a compelling portfolio or agency website that demands attention and sets you apart.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNeed help or have a question? Feel free to reach out at : \u003ca href=\"mailto:hello@framebase.design\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ehello@framebase.design\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e5d:T468,\u003ch2\u003eArtemis Framer Portfolio Template\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eArtemis is a premium Framer portfolio template designed for modern \u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003edesigners\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eartists\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eagencies\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003estudios \u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003ewho want to make a memorable impression. Crafted with a focus on clarity and visual storytelling, it lets you present your projects and creative journey with confidence.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eChangelogs\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e2026/05/11 - \u003c/em\u003eAdded contact form section\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e2026/04/15 - \u003c/em\u003eOptimize for Framer basic plan - 1 CMS\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eKey Features\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClean editorial layout\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBeautiful typography\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSmooth animations\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEffortless brand adaptation\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS-ready project system for simple updates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGlobal styles for instant rebranding\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eBenefits\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eShowcase expertise and win new clients\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStands out on every device\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProfessional online presence that grows with you\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eIdeal for freelancers, agencies, or studios as your launchpad in Framer.\u003c/p\u003e5e:T54d,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTransform your creative portfolio into a stunning macOS experience.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis isn't just another portfolio template, it's a meticulously crafted digital workspace that brings the elegance and simplicity of Apple's design language to your personal brand. Perfect for creative directors, brand designers, photographers, and visual artists who want to stand out with a portfolio that feels as premium as their work.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat makes MakOS different:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ \u003cstrong\u003eInteractive resume experience\u003c/strong\u003e - Your CV isn't buried in a PDF. It lives in a beautifully designed, scannable interface that reads like Apple Notes meets LinkedIn\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ \u003cstrong\u003eModular project showcase\u003c/strong\u003e — Flexible gallery layouts to present case studies, photography, branding work, or any creative output. Each project tells its story\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ \u003cstrong\u003ePerformance-obsessed\u003c/strong\u003e — Lightweight, fast-loading, and optimized. Built following Apple's own performance principles\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreative Directors • Brand Designers • Art Directors • Visual Designers • UI/UX Designers • Graphic Designers • Photographers • Illustrators • Motion Designers • Creative Consultants • Freelance Creatives • Agency Founders • Design Leaders • Portfolio Sites • Personal Branding\u003c/p\u003e5f:T9a5,\u003cp\u003eAgentLab is a premium Framer 3.0 ready template for AI agent startups, automation platforms, and SaaS products that need to look serious from day one.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMost early AI products lose trust because the website feels unfinished. AgentLab helps you launch with a polished, enterprise-ready presence that makes your product feel funded, credible, and worth paying for.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/64458-agentlab-rTeENdyLIKuwI1rXiGr1oOHsROufBJ\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.figma.com/design/ozGXEnrBoMfDF2dzCf93n4/AgentLab-SaaS---AI-Template-Figma?node-id=608-34752\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ePreview File\u003c/a\u003e →\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eBuilt to Look Fundable\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eGive investors, early users, and customers a strong first impression. AgentLab helps your AI product feel mature before you even have a large team behind it.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e4 Hero Layouts Included\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eChoose from Classic Hero, AI Prompt, Centered, or Dashboard — so your website starts with the right first impression.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eMade to Convert\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eGet a proven website flow that explains your product, shows real use cases, builds trust, presents pricing, captures leads, and turns attention into action.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eLaunch Faster\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSkip the blank canvas. Update your content, connect your links, adjust your brand, and publish with a complete website foundation ready to go.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhat’s Inside\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e15+ ready pages for a serious AI company\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct, pricing, case study, blog, changelog, waitlist, and legal pages\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFree Figma file for custom graphics and product visuals\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI visual prompts to create matching brand assets\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConversion-focused copy structure for AI products\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eReusable interactions and animations built for Framer\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI customization guideline included\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLifetime updates and unlimited support\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e25% off Framer Pro\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003ePerfect For\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI agent startups\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI workflow platforms\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAutomation products\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSaaS companies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInvestor-ready landing pages\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct-led teams\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eB2B AI tools\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eEverything a serious AI company needs. Nothing you don’t.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor any query or customization support \u003ca href=\"mailto: amanidesign786@gmail.com\"\u003eemail\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e60:T94b,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://launchfolio.framer.website/?utm_source=framer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eLive Preview\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eLaunchfolio: A portfolio template that helps designers land more clients.\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt after studying dozens of successful design businesses, this template helps you launch your design business in days, not months.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eBuilt for Conversion\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvery section is strategically placed to guide potential clients toward hiring you. From projects to testimonials, each element builds trust and encourages action. It\u0026#39;s completely customizable. The minimal design means you can adapt it to your style without breaking what makes it convert.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy most design portfolios fail to convert:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eToo focused on aesthetics over conversion\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMissing key trust-building elements\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo clear user journey. This template solves all of that.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFlexible Image System\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe multi-reference approach lets you create side-by-side comparisons, and add custom descriptions to explain your process—all without modifying the template structure.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e12/7/25* Image system now supports video file uploads\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ch2\u003eBlog\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eIncludes category filters and search\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2/19/26\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis template has been updated to support Framers new dynamic filters\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/48356-launchnow-q6sjU0smD4uPwuj0KoOOvfaD4DG5nM\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch2\u003eProfessional Quote Generation\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInclude detailed project briefs\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProfessional terms and conditions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAutomatically calculates subtotal , vat, and grand total based off line item entries.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/48356-launchnow-WTRCSrrNxlMa7Ok0vu17G0K8mjuuII\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch2\u003eBuilt for Real Use\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClean, minimal design that adapts to your style\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMobile-optimized viewing\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSEO-friendly structure\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eReal talk: Most designers spend weeks (or months) building their portfolio...and still end up with something that doesn\u0026#39;t convert visitors into clients. Why start from scratch when you can build in days with a template that\u0026#39;s designed to help you win more clients.\u003c/h2\u003e61:Ta5e,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlatform\u003c/strong\u003e is a premium Framer template built around one principle: every section earns its place. The bento-style modular layout lets you rearrange, swap, or remove sections without breaking anything — giving you full creative control over a structure. Dark, editorial aesthetics pair with fluid micro-interactions and video background to deliver a first impression your competitors won\u0026#39;t match.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWho Is This Template For?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt for founders and creators who can\u0026#39;t afford to look like a template — but also can\u0026#39;t afford months of custom development.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSaaS startups\u003c/strong\u003e launching their first or next product\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI \u0026amp; ML companies\u003c/strong\u003e that need to signal technical credibility fast\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSolo founders \u0026amp; solopreneurs\u003c/strong\u003e who want a premium web presence without an agency budget\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDigital agencies \u0026amp; studios\u003c/strong\u003e looking for a client-ready base they can actually stand behind\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTech platforms \u0026amp; infrastructure products\u003c/strong\u003e with complex offerings to showcase simply\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eGoing further — Extended Pro\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSelect Extended Pro at \u003ca href=\"https://polar.sh/checkout/polar_c_ONIlUjgV3Fl8HfWOQPHcEVTpDzMWxLlOJYyIj1jW1Mv\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003echeckout \u003c/a\u003efor:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUnlimited Domains\u003c/strong\u003e — Use the template across multiple client or personal projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFigma Source File\u003c/strong\u003e — A fully layered, production-ready replica of the template.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePremium Lifetime Support\u003c/strong\u003e — No chatbot. No ticket queue. No automated replies. Questions go directly to Tamas, the designer behind Platform.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_PIPVsPf0AlqLTO6DasVPQ4KHibQXi8dRvU2TD0RkeYS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eAll-Access for $299\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eGet instant access to every Framer template I’ve created with Extended Pro license including: \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNubo (NEW), Spector, Vertical, Create\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"registered\"\u003e®\u003c/span\u003e, Platform, Arpeggio, Rescale and Rebirth.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe current template value is \u003cstrong\u003eover $1000\u003c/strong\u003e (with Extended Pro license including Figma files)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat’s included:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRemix links for all current templates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFigma source files for all templates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUnlimited domain usage (reuse on multiple domains)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e50% discount for all future templates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLifetime Update \u0026amp; Priority Support\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e62:T483,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTaylor\u003c/strong\u003e is a standout premium agency and portfolio template created to elevate how your work is presented. It’s a versatile solution for designers, freelancers, creative studios, digital agencies, photographers, and anyone in the creative space looking to display their work with clarity and sophistication. Its clean, minimal approach ensures your projects remain the center of attention, letting your work speak without distraction.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you’re launching a new portfolio or refining an existing one, Taylor strikes a thoughtful balance between simplicity and elegance. The layout is built to highlight each project effectively, giving your work room to breathe while maintaining a polished, professional look. Every element is intentionally designed to support strong visual storytelling and leave a lasting impression on clients and collaborators.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor creatives who take their presentation seriously, Taylor offers a powerful and stylish way to stand out. It provides all the essentials needed to build a compelling portfolio or agency presence that captures attention and communicates quality with confidence.\u003c/p\u003e63:T8c2,\u003ch2\u003eAbout template\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eMike Bennet is a clean, minimal portfolio template for designers who want to launch fast and present their work in a more professional, premium way.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt primarily for \u003cstrong\u003ebrand designers\u003c/strong\u003e, it helps you turn your projects into a polished portfolio site without spending days figuring out structure, layout, or CMS setup from scratch. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you are applying for jobs, sending your portfolio to potential clients, or simply upgrading your online presence, Mike Bennet is designed to help you make a stronger first impression with less effort.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhy Mike Bennet\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eMost portfolio templates either feel too generic or too overloaded. Mike Bennet takes a more focused approach.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt is designed to keep attention on your work through a clean structure, bold typography, and a project-first layout that feels creative, professional, and easy to navigate.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/57037-mike-bennet-gApN0jXrKK5fOYqljzXVkvdDaA9vQJ\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch2\u003eBest for\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBrand designers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGraphic designers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eArt directors\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigners building a personal portfolio\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreatives who want a premium portfolio without a complicated setup\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMotion designers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhat this template helps you do\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLaunch your portfolio faster\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreate a stronger and more professional first impression\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eShowcase projects in a clean, premium format\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSend a portfolio link with more confidence\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eManage projects through a simpler CMS-driven structure\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/57037-mike-bennet-GTizoXzKeEzd0HTughTv75p1IYv33x\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch2\u003eImage and Video Support\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eShow your work in the format that fits it best. Project cards and project presentation can support both image and video-based content, making the template suitable for a wider range of visual work.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eSupport\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you need help with anything, email me at \u003ca href=\"mailto:webdesignbylazar@gmail.com\"\u003ewebdesignbylazar@gmail.com\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e64:T501,\u003cp\u003eViper is a remarkable creative agency \u0026amp; portfolio template crafted to enhance your agency's or portfolio presentation. It’s an ideal portfolio solution for creative designers, freelancers, creative agencies, digital agencies, personal portfolio, photographers, or anyone in the creative industry who wants to showcase their agency's or portfolio in a clean and sophisticated way. The creative design keeps the focus entirely on agency's or portfolio's look, allowing the work to speak for itself.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you're building your first agency/portfolio or looking to refresh your existing one, Viper offers the perfect balance of creativity and elegance. Its portfolio-centric layout ensures that every project in your portfolio or agency stands out, free from unnecessary clutter. This template is designed for professionals who value the importance of a well-curated portfolio and agency, helping to make a lasting impression on clients and employers. If you're looking for a powerful and stylish way to present your portfolio or agency, Viper is the ideal choice to take your portfolio or agency to the next level.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor anyone serious about their portfolio, Viper provides everything needed to create a striking portfolio or agency's that commands attention.\u003c/p\u003e65:T721,\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"sparkles\"\u003e✨\u003c/span\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://templifica.com/framer-templates/mattis?utm_source=framer\u0026amp;utm_medium=marketplace\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFull template tour →\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAgency websites have a specific problem. They need to do three things at once. Show great work, build trust fast, and make booking a project feel like the obvious next step. Most templates get one of those right. MATTIS® was built to handle all three without making you fight the structure.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWho it\u0026#39;s for\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesign studios. Development shops. Marketing teams. Video production. Full-cycle agencies. If you sell your work to businesses and your current site isn\u0026#39;t pulling its weight, this is the fastest way to fix that without a three-month redesign.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eIncluded with MATTIS®:\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGetting started guide\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eClear instructions for customizing your template\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrelaunch checklist\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e60+ checks so nothing breaks on launch day.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEmail support\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDirect replies from the creator within 24 hours.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLifetime updates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMoving forward with the industry. Always up to date.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e25% Off Framer Pro Yearly\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e$90 value, included\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/62149-mattis-9LCmIrCJ9hb8Dlci3w42yyi5OKP9S7\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch3\u003eChangelog\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1.0\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInitial release.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eContacts\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eQuestions? Reach out via \u003ca href=\"https://x.com/bynneh\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ex.com\u003c/a\u003e or email \u003ca href=\"mailto:hello@templifica.com\"\u003ehello@templifica.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e66:T569,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://palmer-template.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eLive Preview\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePalmer is a remarkable portfolio \u0026amp; agency template crafted to enhance your portfolio\u0026#39;s or agency\u0026#39;s presentation. It’s an ideal portfolio solution for designers, freelancers, creative agencies, digital agencies, photographers, or anyone in the creative industry who wants to showcase their portfolio or agency\u0026#39;s in a clean and sophisticated way. The minimal design keeps the focus entirely on your portfolio or agency, allowing the work to speak for itself.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you\u0026#39;re building your first portfolio or looking to refresh your existing one, Palmer offers the perfect balance of simplicity and elegance. Its portfolio-centric layout ensures that every project in your portfolio or agency stands out, free from unnecessary clutter. This template is designed for professionals who value the importance of a well-curated portfolio and agency, helping to make a lasting impression on clients and employers. If you\u0026#39;re looking for a powerful and stylish way to present your portfolio or agency, Palmer is the ideal choice to take your portfolio or agency to the next level.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor anyone serious about their portfolio, Palmer provides everything needed to create a striking portfolio or agency\u0026#39;s that commands attention.\u003c/p\u003e67:T6b7,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://norelltemplate.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eView live demo\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNorell is a creative portfolio and agency Framer template for design studios, branding agencies, and freelance designers. Build a complete website to showcase photography, design, or branding work with a minimalist aesthetic and bold typography.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe template includes a CMS project gallery, a services section covering Branding, Development, Motion Design, and UI/UX, testimonials, built-in pricing tables, and a CMS blog across 10 or more pages.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhat is Included\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e10 or more pages covering Home, About, Services, Projects, Blog, Contact, Pricing, and legal pages. CMS-driven detail pages support both project and blog content, manageable without code.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eKey Features\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe services section covers Branding, Development, Motion Design, and UI/UX categories. Pricing tables present offerings clearly to visitors. The testimonials section highlights client feedback. Dynamic CMS integration supports adding new projects, blog posts, or team members at any time.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWho This Is For\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSuited to creative studios, design agencies, branding and art direction firms, freelance designers, and motion design and UX agencies needing a minimal portfolio-forward website.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTemplate Details\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePlatform Framer, 10 or more pages, CMS-driven project and blog sections, pricing tables, testimonials section, legal pages included, fully responsive, no code required, one purchase for unlimited sites.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNorell gives creative studios and agencies a clean, design-led website with a CMS portfolio, structured services, and built-in pricing for client conversion.\u003c/p\u003e68:Tb9a,\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"link\"\u003e🔗\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://meeko-template.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eLive preview →\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"point_right\"\u003e👉\u003c/span\u003e  \u003ca href=\"https://www.framer.com/@elemis-themes/?tab=template\u0026amp;sort=popular\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eBrowse more free templates →\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMeeko is a modern Framer portfolio template built for designers, developers, freelancers, and creative professionals who want a clean and professional portfolio website.\u003c/strong\u003e With flexible layouts, CMS-powered content, and reusable UI components, Meeko makes it easy to launch a polished personal portfolio.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe template includes \u003cstrong\u003e3 home page layouts and 2 portfolio layout options\u003c/strong\u003e, giving you multiple ways to present your projects and customize the structure of your site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMeeko also features modern interactions including \u003cstrong\u003eslideshows, sticky navigation, smooth animations, and scroll-based animations\u003c/strong\u003e, creating a dynamic browsing experience while keeping the design minimal and professional.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you are creating a \u003cstrong\u003edesigner portfolio, developer portfolio, or creative personal website\u003c/strong\u003e, Meeko includes the essential sections and components needed to showcase your work, skills, and experience clearly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eKey Features\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3 Home Page Layouts\u003c/strong\u003e – Three modern home page designs for a strong first impression.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2 Portfolio Layouts\u003c/strong\u003e – Two flexible layouts to showcase your work.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePortfolio CMS\u003c/strong\u003e – Easily manage and display portfolio projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBlog CMS\u003c/strong\u003e – Publish articles and improve SEO with the built-in blog.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSlideshow Sections\u003c/strong\u003e – Showcase featured projects and content\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTabs Component\u003c/strong\u003e – Organize services, skills, or testimonials.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTestimonial Sections\u003c/strong\u003e – Display client feedback with tabs or sliders.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSkills with Progress Bars\u003c/strong\u003e – Present your expertise visually.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnimated Counters\u003c/strong\u003e – Highlight key numbers and achievements.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExperience Timeline\u003c/strong\u003e – Showcase your career and milestones.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFAQ Section\u003c/strong\u003e – Organize common questions with an accordion.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProcess Section\u003c/strong\u003e – Explain your workflow step by step.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContact Form\u003c/strong\u003e – Make it easy for clients to get in touch.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eModern Interactions\u003c/strong\u003e – Smooth animations, sticky navigation, slideshows, scroll effects, and interactive testimonials.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFully Responsive\u003c/strong\u003e – Optimized for desktop, tablet, and mobile.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e69:T8d9,\u003ch3\u003eA bold Framer template for modern AI agencies\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eSpartan is built for AI agencies, automation studios, consultants, SaaS teams, and tech companies that want a strong online presence without designing everything from scratch.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt combines sharp visuals, clear layouts, smooth animations, and conversion-focused sections to help you explain your services, build trust, and attract better clients.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eBuilt for ambitious AI teams\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSpartan is a great fit for businesses offering:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI automation\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI agents\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMachine learning\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustom software\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eData solutions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI consulting\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSaaS products\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWorkflow systems\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe layout helps you turn complex services into clear messages that potential clients can understand.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eLaunch without the long process\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSpartan gives you a complete website foundation that is ready to customize in Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eUpdate the copy, colors, fonts, images, buttons, sections, and pages to match your brand. No coding is required.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eEverything your agency needs\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3\u003eService sections\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eClearly explain what you offer and how your solutions help clients.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eCase studies\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eShow your work, results, and process in a way that builds confidence.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eTestimonials\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdd client feedback to make your agency feel more trusted and established.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePricing and FAQs\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003ePresent your offers, answer common questions, and remove doubts before prospects reach out.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eContact forms\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eMake it easy for visitors to book a call, request a quote, or start a project.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eEasy to edit\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSpartan is fully customizable in Framer and uses reusable components to keep your website clean and consistent.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou can update:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eColors and fonts\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eImages and copy\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePages and sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eButtons and animations\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eResponsive on every screen\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvery page is designed to look polished and work smoothly across desktop, tablet, and mobile.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eDesigned to convert\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSpartan helps you explain your offer, show your expertise, answer objections, and guide visitors toward taking action.\u003c/p\u003e6a:Tb3a,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConstantine – Creative Agency \u0026amp; Designer Portfolio Framer Template\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eConstantine is a refined and modern Framer template designed for creative agencies, independent designers, and digital studios looking to showcase their work with clarity and confidence. Built with a strong visual hierarchy and clean, structured layouts, it helps present projects, services, and brand stories in a way that feels both professional and visually compelling.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eTemplate Pages\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHome\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAbout\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlog\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlog Details\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProject\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProject Details\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePricing\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e404 Page\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGet the Figma\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNeed the Figma source file? Just email us at \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"mailto:finlaystudiouix@gmail.com\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003efinlaystudiouix@gmail.com\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e, and we\u0026#39;ll send it to you.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSetup Guide\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNeed help setting up your website? Email us at \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"mailto:finlaystudiouix@gmail.com\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003efinlaystudiouix@gmail.com\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e, and we\u0026#39;ll send you a complete setup guide.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAll-Access — $199\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGet it now: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://dub.sh/Allaccesspass\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ehttps://dub.sh/Allaccesspass\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUnlock every Framer template I\u0026#39;ve created with the Extended Pro license.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGet access to 35+ premium Framer templates valued at over $1,000, including Extended Pro licensing and Figma source files.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat\u0026#39;s Included\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e35+ premium Framer templates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRemix links for all current templates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFigma source files for every template\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUnlimited domain usage for personal and client projects\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e50% discount on all future templates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLifetime updates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePriority support\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContacts\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIf you have any questions regarding the template, feel free to reach out via X: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://x.com/emonpixels\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ehttps://x.com/emonpixels\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOr email: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"mailto:finlaystudiouix@gmail.com\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003efinlaystudiouix@gmail.com\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFind more great templates here: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.framer.com/@tawfiqulemon/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ehttps://www.framer.com/@tawfiqulemon/\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e6b:T589,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eZara Miller\u003c/strong\u003e is a refined yet expressive Framer portfolio template crafted for creatives who value clarity, elegance, and intentional storytelling. Designed with a clean, modern aesthetic and thoughtful layouts, it’s perfect for designers, photographers, developers, and independent creators who want to present their work with confidence and sophistication.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlending minimal design with subtle visual depth, Zara Miller allows your projects to take center stage. From immersive case studies to smooth navigation and balanced typography, every detail is built to create a seamless browsing experience that feels polished and professional. Whether you’re building a personal brand or showcasing a curated body of work, this template helps you leave a lasting impression.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhy Choose Zara Miller?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong\u003eElegant Visual Presence: \u003c/strong\u003eA clean, modern design that highlights your work without distractions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🎨 \u003cstrong\u003eEasy Customization: \u003c/strong\u003eQuickly adjust colors, typography, and layouts to reflect your personal brand.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🚀 \u003cstrong\u003eOptimized Performance: \u003c/strong\u003eFast-loading pages designed to keep visitors engaged.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e📱 \u003cstrong\u003eFully Responsive: \u003c/strong\u003eLooks and works beautifully across all devices and screen sizes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🔎 \u003cstrong\u003eSEO-Friendly Structure: \u003c/strong\u003eBuilt with best practices to help your portfolio get discovered.\u003c/p\u003e6c:T948,\u003cp\u003eFiber is a clean, editorial portfolio template designed for creative agencies and design studios. Built with care in Framer — every detail considered, every section purposeful.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhat's included:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Home page with animated Motion Layer scroller and hero text\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Works collection — CMS-powered project pages with title, client, roles, and date\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Shots grid — visual archive for quick design snapshots\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Info page — services, clients, recognition, and press\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Services page\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- 404 page\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Fully responsive — desktop, tablet, and mobile\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHow to use:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1. Loader — the intro animation plays automatically on page load. To edit the duration or disable it, select the Loader component on the canvas and adjust the delay settings in the right panel.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"blob:https://www.framer.com/4d529908-4baf-43b9-8d7c-1123f977641b\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp\u003eAlso, while customizing, select the page and temporarily hide the Loader on the right side. This will help you easily customize the pages.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e2. Motion Layer (Home page) — the horizontal scrolling marquee in the hero section is powered by the Motion Layer component. To update the items, select the component, open its properties, and edit the list directly. You can adjust speed, direction, and gap from the same panel.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/64046-fiber-2Y9EFxRqZgssIxmUATL5JX9Rhet0uU\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor Motion Layers, the CMS is connected via separate filters. If you want to showcase more work on the Home page, simply duplicate the CMS blocks on the right side and sequentially continue the \"Start at\" property of the Order there.3. CMS — go to the CMS panel, open the Works collection, and replace the placeholder content with your own projects. Add cover images to each item. The Shots collection works the same way — just swap in your visuals.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e4. Colors and fonts — all styles are managed through the Styles panel. Change the primary font or color palette in one place and it updates across the entire site.For questions, customization requests, or anything else — drop a line at \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:jamshidbektashpulatov@gmail.com\"\u003ejamshidbektashpulatov@gmail.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned for studios. Built for speed. \u003c/p\u003e6d:Ta24,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOBERON\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"registered\"\u003e®\u003c/span\u003e is an operations-first Framer template designed for AI automation agencies, consultants, and modern operators who build systems that help businesses work smarter and scale efficiently.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith fully customizable components, a structured layout, and integrated CMS, Oberon helps you present your expertise through a clean, systems-driven interface. Technical details, purposeful motion, and a distinctive visual language create a premium experience without unnecessary complexity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerfect for launching an operations-focused business: modern, scalable, and fully responsive. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEffortless customization\u003c/strong\u003e – easily adapt every section to fit your brand and services\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResponsive design\u003c/strong\u003e – optimized for desktops, tablets, and mobile devices\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSimple content management\u003c/strong\u003e – update text, images, projects, and case studies in minutes\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSystems-driven design\u003c/strong\u003e – a distinctive interface built around operations, workflows, and execution\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt-in CMS\u003c/strong\u003e – manage projects with ease\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eComprehensive structure\u003c/strong\u003e – includes all essential pages to showcase services, industries, projects, and workflows\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDetailed instructions\u003c/strong\u003e – a complete guide is included to help you customize and launch your website effortlessly\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePAGES INCLUDED:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHome\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAbout\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSolutions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCase Studies (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCase Study (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContacts\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrivacy Policy (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTerms Of Service (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e404\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRefund Policy:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs these are digital products, all sales are final, and refunds cannot be provided. Please review all product details carefully before purchasing.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContacts:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIf you have some questions regarding the template, feel free to reach out to me at \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://x.com/_mayweather\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ehttps://x.com/_mayweather\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e or via email at: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"mailto:tymofii.bak@gmail.com\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003etymofii.bak@gmail.com\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFind more great templates at \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://OneTwoFrame.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOneTwoFrame.com\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e6e:T79d,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFusion AI is a premium Framer 3.0 ready template \u003c/strong\u003ebuilt for AI agent startups, SaaS teams, automation platforms, and product-led companies that want to launch a high-trust website faster.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt for AI Startups\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFusion AI is designed for AI products, automation tools, agent platforms, Web3 startups, and growth-focused SaaS companies that need a polished website without wasting weeks on design and development.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDesigned to Convert\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eInstead of starting from a blank canvas, you get a complete website system built around clarity, credibility, and conversion. Every page and section is structured to help visitors understand your product, trust your solution, and take action.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReady for Framer 3.0\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt for the new AI-native Framer workflow, Fusion AI is easy to customize, extend, and improve with Framer Agents. Update content, adjust sections, explore new layouts, and move faster with a clean, flexible foundation.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat’s Included\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e10 pre-designed pages 50+ reusable responsive components CMS-powered blog and legal collections Forms, scroll effects, and appear effects Responsive layouts for desktop, tablet, and mobile Clean structure for fast customization and publishing\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFigma File Included\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFusion AI also includes a fully customizable Figma file with dashboard screens, ready for custom graphics, brand visuals, and presentation assets.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConsistent Visual System\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e3D image generation prompts are included, so you can create visuals in the same style and keep your website consistent across pages.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect For\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI agent startups SaaS products Automation platforms Web3 companies Product-led teams Growth-focused startups\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor any query or customization support \u003ca href=\"mailto:amanidesign786@gmail.com\"\u003eemail\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e6f:T7f5,\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKai Marlow is a free portfolio website template for Framer that helps designers, studios, and creatives launch a portfolio that makes visitors stop and look in a few hours.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eKai Marlow uses an editorial layout with oversized serif type and a 3D project carousel. It looks nothing like the templates recruiters and clients see every day. You add projects through Framer\u0026#39;s CMS. Drop in images, video, or both and organize them with category filters. You do not need to code or hire a developer. You can stop delaying and publish in a few hours.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Junior designers who need a portfolio before their first job interview and have no time to build from scratch\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Freelance creatives who want to look credible when clients ask for their website\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Design studios that need to show many project types without changing the layout each time\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Recent graduates with strong student work but no live site to show it\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Anyone who has been \u0026quot;working on their portfolio\u0026quot; for months and needs to finish it this week\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat\u0026#39;s included\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEditorial homepage:\u003c/strong\u003e A 3D project carousel and oversized serif type that makes visitors stop scrolling and remember your work long after.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImage and video galleries:\u003c/strong\u003e Add photos and video to any project so you can show static work, motion, and case studies in one place.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI prompt pack:\u003c/strong\u003e Let Framer\u0026#39;s AI Agent customize colors, fonts, and content for you without you ever needing to touch the design.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization guide:\u003c/strong\u003e A step-by-step manual that walks you through every edit if you prefer to customize the template yourself by hand.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFramer Pro 25% off:\u003c/strong\u003e Use code to get 25% off Framer Pro Annual and publish your site on your own domain.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSupport\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you get stuck, email \u003ca href=\"mailto:hi@lazarfilipovic.com\"\u003ehi@lazarfilipovic.com\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e70:T8ca,\u003cp\u003eOkta – Creative Agency \u0026amp; Portfolio Framer Template\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOkta is a premium Framer template designed for creative studios, branding agencies, digital agencies, designers, and independent creatives who want a bold and memorable online presence. With its editorial-inspired layout, striking typography, dark aesthetic, and vibrant visual accents, Okta gives your brand a distinctive identity from the first interaction.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShowcase your best work through a carefully structured portfolio experience, highlight branding and creative projects, introduce your design process, and communicate what makes your studio different. Okta includes dedicated sections for featured projects, brand identity, creative process, services, testimonials, FAQs, and contact—everything you need to turn your portfolio into a powerful business tool.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe template is designed to tell a story rather than simply display a collection of projects. Large typography, immersive imagery, subtle interactions, and carefully balanced layouts create a premium experience that keeps visitors engaged and makes your work stand out.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt entirely in Framer, Okta is fully responsive across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices. Customize your colors, typography, images, content, and branding easily using Framer\u0026#39;s intuitive no-code editor. No coding experience is required.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Bold Creative Studio Design \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Portfolio \u0026amp; Project Showcase \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Brand Identity Sections \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Creative Process Showcase \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Services \u0026amp; Capabilities \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Testimonials \u0026amp; Client Reviews \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• FAQ Section \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Contact \u0026amp; Lead Generation \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Responsive Design \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Smooth Animations \u0026amp; Interactions \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• SEO-Friendly Structure \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Performance Optimized \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Easy No-Code Customization\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePerfect For\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Creative Studios \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Branding Agencies \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Design Agencies \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Digital Agencies \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Art Directors \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Graphic Designers \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Creative Freelancers \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Brand Designers \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Portfolio Websites \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Creative Consultants\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuild a portfolio that feels as creative as the work you produce.\u003c/p\u003e71:T720,\u003cp\u003eRecon is a premium Framer template built for AI agent platforms, automation tools, workflow SaaS, and developer-first products that help teams move faster without growing headcount. Whether you\u0026#39;re launching an AI automation platform, building an agentic workflow tool, or creating a developer infrastructure product, Recon gives you a visually stunning, conversion-optimized foundation that communicates power and precision from the first scroll.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI agent platforms \u0026amp; automation tools\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAgentic workflow \u0026amp; orchestration products\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDeveloper-first SaaS \u0026amp; API platforms\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo-code \u0026amp; low-code automation tools\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLLM-powered business applications\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI operations \u0026amp; AIOps platforms\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWorkflow automation \u0026amp; process intelligence\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSales automation \u0026amp; revenue operations tools\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI-powered customer support platforms\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eData pipeline \u0026amp; ETL SaaS products\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDevOps \u0026amp; infrastructure automation tools\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI productivity \u0026amp; copilot applications\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBusiness process automation platforms\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMulti-agent AI systems \u0026amp; frameworks\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGenerative AI enterprise products\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e⚠️ Important: This template is for design and presentation purposes only. It does not include real AI functionality, backend integrations, or live data connections. Implement your own product logic before launching.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt for the agentic era. Designed for teams that ship. Ready to convert technical audiences.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRefund Policy:\u003c/strong\u003e Due to the instant and non-returnable nature of digital products, all purchases are final and refunds will not be issued.\u003c/p\u003e72:T4e4,\u003ch2\u003eWhy Calder\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eCalder isn’t about adding more. It’s about saying more with less.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLarge-scale type, calm spacing, and a confident grid system create a presence that feels editorial, modern, and intentional. Every section is designed to guide attention without noise.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClean, editorial layout with strong typographic focus\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUnique service showcase with dynamic visual arrangement\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMinimal navigation for distraction-free browsing\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully responsive across all devices\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy to customize with your content\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt for speed and performance in Framer\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePerfect for\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct Designers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreative Developers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesign Studios\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFreelancers building a premium personal brand\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eChangelog\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e1.0\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Intial release\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1.1\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Added instructions to address some common issues\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Added video support in the case studies\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eContact\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eNeed help using the template or want to share feedback? Reach out via X or email \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:chayanp188@gmail.com\"\u003echayanp188@gmail.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e73:T928,\u003ch2\u003eLaunch a Modern UGC \u0026amp; Performance Creative Agency — Without Starting From Scratch\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003ePlayback Studio is a premium Framer template built for modern creative agencies, UGC studios, and video production teams. Designed with a clean, contemporary aesthetic and a conversion-focused layout, it helps you showcase your work, build credibility, and attract high-value clients—without starting from scratch.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"fire\"\u003e🔥\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e LAST CHANCE — $19 UNTIL SEPTEMBER 1\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlayback Studio is $19 right now.\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eThe price goes up to $29 on September 1.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWho Is This For?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003ePlayback Studio is perfect for:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ UGC Agencies\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ Video Production Agencies\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ Content Creator Agencies\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ Creative Studios\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ Social Media Marketing Agencies\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ Freelance Videographers\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ Personal Portfolios\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ Content Production Teams\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ Brand Storytelling Studios\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhy Choose Playback Studio?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ Purpose-built for creative agencies and production studios—not a generic portfolio template.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ Clean, modern design that puts your work and visuals first.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ Fully responsive across desktop, tablet, and mobile.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ Built with Framer CMS for effortless project, creator, and blog management.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ High-converting layouts designed to generate more client inquiries.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ Smooth interactions and premium animations for a polished browsing experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhat\u0026#39;s Included\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eEverything you need to launch a professional creative agency website:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHomepage\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAbout\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProjects\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProject Page (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlog\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlog Post (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTerms \u0026amp; Conditions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustom 404 Page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eIncluded resources:\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ Start Here Guide\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ Framer Agent\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ Style Guide\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ SEO \u0026amp; AEO Guide\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✓ Branding Guide\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eNeed help?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor questions about the template, licensing, setup, or customization, contact us at \u003ca href=\"mailto:danixostudio@gmail.com\"\u003eDanixo Studio\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShow the work. Build credibility. Win the next project.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e74:Ta1b,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLive preview:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"http://parley.framer.ai\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eparley.framer.ai\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBundles\u003c/strong\u003e Parley is also available with its Figma file and an AI prompt for rebuilding the site as standalone code in Claude Code, Codex, or your favorite tool. Pick the template alone or a \u003ca href=\"https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_7Q45Ctx5zQj5b442xEeCbt0GFZSBgSHCHDh3I2QfuzY?product_id=6ec699ff-8ea3-4875-8d1d-14414b7de01b\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ebundle at checkout\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA modern AI agent template built on one idea: AI that works with you, not just for you.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eParley is a Framer template for AI startups, SaaS founders, and teams that want a site that reads like a real product, not a side project. A warm, editorial aesthetic that stands apart from the sea of dark, neon AI sites, with the structure to turn visitors into trials.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat\u0026#39;s included\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e11 pages: home, workflows, pricing, blog, contact, waitlist, legal, and 404\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS blog with categories and article pages\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUsage calculator, pricing tiers, integrations showcase, and testimonials\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWaitlist flow with a working form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOrganized styles and reusable components\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEasy to customize\u003c/strong\u003e Everything is native Framer and editable on the canvas. Colors and text styles are tokenized, so a palette or type change carries through the whole site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI agent and automation startups\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSaaS products and developer tools\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSolo founders launching fast\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTeams replacing a dated landing page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt with care\u003c/strong\u003e Accessible structure, one clean H1 per page, unique titles and descriptions, descriptive alt text, and three tuned breakpoints. The unglamorous work is already done.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGet 3 months of Framer Pro free\u003c/strong\u003e The promo code is inside the template. Apply it to the yearly Pro plan at checkout. Framer\u0026#39;s terms apply.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease note\u003c/strong\u003e Parley is a template and demonstration brand. Connect your own forms, analytics, and services before launch.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSupport\u003c/strong\u003e Questions or help getting set up? Reach us any time at \u003ca href=\"mailto:alex@apollostudio.design\"\u003ealex@apollostudio.design\u003c/a\u003e. Designed and built by \u003ca href=\"https://apollostudio.design/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eApollo Studio.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e75:T890,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://manner.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLive Preview →\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eManner avoids visual noise and short lived trends, so visitors quickly understand who you are, what you do, and why it matters.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhat makes Manner different?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClarity First :- \u003c/strong\u003eClear layouts and strong hierarchy guide visitors through your work, services, and process with ease.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFocused Presentation:\u003c/strong\u003e-\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c/strong\u003eNo gimmicks or unnecessary effects. A clean, considered structure that lets your work speak for itself.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProven Agency Structure:- \u003c/strong\u003eBuilt around how real agencies and studios present themselves, not experimental or trend driven layouts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you’re a designer, agency, or studio, Manner gives you the tools to build a site that clearly represents your work, expertise, and brand.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePages Included\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHome:- \u003c/strong\u003eA structured landing page that introduces your studio and highlights key work.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStudio / About:- \u003c/strong\u003eShare your story, values, and approach with clarity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWork (CMS):- \u003c/strong\u003eA flexible system for showcasing case studies and selected projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNews (CMS):- \u003c/strong\u003ePublish updates, articles, or insights using a scalable layout.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContact \u0026amp; Legal Pages:- \u003c/strong\u003eEverything needed for a complete, professional website.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eChangelog\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e1.0\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Intial release\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1.1\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Added a more robust Services section for greater flexibility\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Fixed an issue where the header occasionally did not appear in Safari\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1.2\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Replaced Smooth Scroll with Lenis for better performance.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1.3\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Added a more comprehensive setup guide\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1.4\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Reworked the entire CMS system to make it more robust and scalable than ever.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Added video support with compatibility for file formats like WebM and MP4.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eContact\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eNeed help using the template or want to share feedback? Reach out via \u003ca href=\"mailto:chayanp188@gmail.com\"\u003eemail chayanp188@gmail.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e76:T7f4,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCohesion\u003c/strong\u003e is a Framer template for agencies, portfolios and personal brands. It pairs minimalist layout with dynamic motion, so the work stays centre stage while transitions, 3D elements and custom cursors carry the personality.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePages:\u003c/strong\u003e Home, Licensing and 404, plus CMS-driven project and legal templates. It also ships a full member area wired to FramerAuth V2: Sign in, Sign up, Forgot password, Reset password and Account. The homepage runs a ticker hero with a 3D element and memoji, rotating stack text, skills and about cards, a tools and stack logo row, services, the project collection, and a testimonials slider.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2 CMS collections\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProjects:\u003c/strong\u003e title, date, client, category, duration, three images, live website link, a configurable buy or remix button with custom label, short and long content, and a meta description for SEO\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLegal:\u003c/strong\u003e title and formatted content, rendered through the legal page template\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eEverything else is built as reusable components, so the CMS stays light. Add a project and the collection stack, cards and detail page populate from one entry.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWho it\u0026#39;s for\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eFreelancers and independent designers presenting a small, strong body of work. Studios and agencies wanting a single-page site with real motion. Personal brands who need a portfolio plus licensing and account pages without a heavy CMS to maintain.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNot the right fit if you need a blog, multi-author content or deep case study structure.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Cohesion?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe animation does actual work here. Sticky scroll sections, tickers, a slideshow, 3D and custom cursors are built in rather than bolted on, and Public Sans keeps the typography clean underneath. Accessibility, SEO and responsive layouts are handled, colour and text styles are defined throughout, and the FramerAuth pages mean gated or client-only areas are ready if you want them.\u003c/p\u003e77:T9cb,\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"art\"\u003e🎨\u003c/span\u003e FREE FIGMA FILE INCLUDED WITH THIS TEMPLATE\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e-------------------------------\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eUnlock 350+ Templates: \u003ca href=\"https://framerbite.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://framerbite.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAccess 5600+ Components to Build Website Fast: \u003ca href=\"https://grayblocks.net/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://grayblocks.net/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e-------------------------------\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBartix — SaaS \u0026amp; Startup Framer Template\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBartix is a premium SaaS template for startups on the Framer marketplace. Built for SaaS founders and startup teams shipping AI products fast — a landing page that converts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePERFECT FOR EVERY SAAS:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Early-Stage Startup \u0026amp; Funded Startup\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Bootstrapped Startup \u0026amp; VC-Backed Startup\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- B2B Startup \u0026amp; B2C Startup\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Tech Startup \u0026amp; Product Startup\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Solo Startup \u0026amp; Team Startup\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Scaling Startup \u0026amp; Seed Startup\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Pre-Launch Startup \u0026amp; Growth Startup\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Indie Startup \u0026amp; Venture Startup\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Lean Startup \u0026amp; Agile Startup\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Product Landing Page \u0026amp; App Landing Page\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Marketing Landing Page \u0026amp; Conversion Landing Page\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Hero Landing Page \u0026amp; Sales Landing Page\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Lead-Gen Landing Page \u0026amp; Signup Landing Page\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Mobile Landing Page \u0026amp; Responsive Landing Page\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Modern Landing Page \u0026amp; Clean Landing Page\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- High-Converting Landing Page \u0026amp; Optimized Landing Page\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Generative AI \u0026amp; Predictive AI\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Conversational AI \u0026amp; Autonomous AI\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Vision AI \u0026amp; Voice AI\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Chat AI \u0026amp; Agent AI\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Enterprise AI \u0026amp; Developer AI\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- No-Code AI \u0026amp; API AI\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Workflow AI\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- B2B SaaS \u0026amp; Cloud SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Vertical SaaS \u0026amp; Micro SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Enterprise SaaS \u0026amp; Developer SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Marketing SaaS \u0026amp; Analytics SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- CRM SaaS \u0026amp; Fintech SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Healthtech SaaS \u0026amp; Mobile SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Web SaaS \u0026amp; Data SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Workflow SaaS \u0026amp; Subscription SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Automation SaaS \u0026amp; Growth SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Modern SaaS \u0026amp; Scalable SaaS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSAAS PAGES:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Homepage\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Pricing Page\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Features Page\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Blog \u0026amp; CMS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- 404 Page\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWHY STARTUPS CHOOSE BARTIX:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- AI-ready and fast\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- A landing page that converts\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Built for SaaS and B2B\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLaunch your SaaS startup landing page today — Bartix ships it.\u003c/p\u003e78:T8c6,\u003ch3\u003eBuilt for SaaS. Designed to Convert.\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eFintechX is a premium Framer template designed for modern finance platforms, from investment apps and trading tools to personal finance dashboards and fintech SaaS products. Built with conversion in mind, every section is structured to build trust immediately and push visitors toward action, whether that\u0026#39;s signing up, exploring pricing, or connecting their existing tools.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe template ships as a fully structured, scroll-ready landing page that covers the complete buyer journey. It opens with a hero packed with social proof stats, moves through feature showcases and a live finance dashboard preview, then builds confidence with security messaging, real user testimonials, and a persona-based section that clearly communicates who the product is built for. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFintechX pairs a clean light UI with premium photography to create a look that feels both modern and trustworthy. In a space where credibility matters, the aesthetic does as much work as the copy.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eComplete Landing Page\u003c/strong\u003e - Every section a finance or fintech product needs, in the right order, ready to go\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eData-Driven Dashboard UI\u003c/strong\u003e - Realistic finance dashboard mockups with charts, portfolio views, and transaction UIs\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNature-Inspired Premium Design\u003c/strong\u003e - Light UI with organic photography accents that build trust on first impression\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSEO Optimized\u003c/strong\u003e - Built with Framer\u0026#39;s automated SEO tools and achieves a perfect 100/100 SEO score\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePage Speed Optimized - \u003c/strong\u003eBuilt for fast loading and smooth performance across all devices.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhat You Will Get After Purchase:\u003c/h3\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRemix link for this Framer template\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFigma file of the template\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCoupon code for Free Framer Pro (annual plan) for 3 Months\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003ch3\u003eBest Suited For\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eFintech, investment platform, finance SaaS, personal finance app, stock trading, wealth management, financial dashboard, money management, finance startup, financial services, trading platform, fintech landing page, finance product launch, investment software\u003c/p\u003e79:T55e,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://kima.framer.media/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eLive Preview\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKima\u003c/strong\u003e is a minimal portfolio template designed to showcase work in a unique and engaging way. Featuring independently scrolling left and right sections, perfect for designers, creatives, and photographers who want their work to stand out with clarity and sophistication.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eKima creates a dynamic browsing experience that highlights content without distraction. Clean typography, balanced layouts, and subtle interactions keep the focus on your projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhat’s Included\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDetailed instructions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e3 months free of Framer Pro\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUse on unlimited projects\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e24-hour email support\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLifetime updates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhy Choose Kima\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy customization\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully responsive\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS collection for projects\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSleek masonry grid\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDark/Light theme\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSEO optimized\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerformance optimized\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/58971-kima-PIOtMWUc2BCllATe4YG8TDS1krbAD5\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch3\u003eContact\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eFeel free to reach out if you have any questions: \u003ca href=\"mailto:thaerswailem@gmail.com\"\u003ethaerswailem@gmail.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e7a:Ta56,\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"point_right\"\u003e👉\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://boolka.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e Live Preview\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.framer.com/@rkoby/?tab=template\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eMORE TEMPLATES →\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBoolka - Bakery \u0026amp; cafe Framer template\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBoolka is a warm and playful Framer template created for cafes, bakeries, brunch spots, coffee shops, and food brands with a strong personality.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt around bold typography, appetising photography, expressive colours, and relaxed editorial layouts, Boolka helps turn a simple cafe website into a memorable digital experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe template gives visitors everything they need to explore the menu, discover the story behind the place, check opening hours and location details, and make a booking. Every section is designed to feel welcoming, fresh, and full of character.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMade fresh for cafe culture.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eIncluded pages\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHome\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMenu\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAbout\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e404\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eKey features\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBold and playful cafe design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLarge food-focused hero section\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMenu and featured item layouts\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOpening hours and location information\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClear booking calls to action\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStory and team sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eImage-led editorial layouts\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSmooth Framer interactions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully responsive across desktop, tablet, and mobile\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy customisation without code\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWho it is for\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIndependent cafes\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eArtisan bakeries\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBrunch restaurants\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCoffee shops\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePastry studios\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSmall restaurant teams\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHospitality brands\u00