3c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eVague positioning that sounds like every other firm\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo proof of outcomes, just promises\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCase studies buried or missing entirely\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGeneric layouts that don\u0026#39;t reflect the quality of the work\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eKora fixes this with a structure built around credibility and conversion.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDeeply Connected CMS\u003c/strong\u003e — Six collections that work together out of the box. Case studies link to services. Insights link to team members and categories. Services power the homepage, contact form, and case study pages simultaneously. Add a service once and it shows up everywhere. Rename a team member and every article they\u0026#39;ve written updates automatically.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eConversion-Focused Components:\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBefore/After Comparison Section\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProcess Accordion\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBar Graph for visualizing results\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTestimonial Accordion with star ratings\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTiered Pricing Cards with benefit lists\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact Form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePerfect For:\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGrowth consultancies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRevenue operations firms\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGo-to-market advisors\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eManagement consulting agencies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStrategy and advisory firms\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eB2B consulting studios\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eBuilt to Ship Fast\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eYour clients hire you because you move fast. Your website should too. Kora gives you a complete, conversion-ready foundation in hours so you can get back to the work that matters.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eContact\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eHave questions? Reach out to me at \u003ca href=\"mailto:joseph@launchnow.design\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ejoseph@launchnow.design\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e7c:T824,\u003cp\u003eFolira is a premium Framer template for creative professionals who want a portfolio that moves. Dynamic interactions, expressive layouts, and CMS-powered case study pages give designers, developers, and studios a site that shows work in motion and reads as both a portfolio and a resume.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey sections\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHero: Animated intro with name, role, and reel\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWorks: CMS project grid with detailed case study pages\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAbout: Bio, approach, and personal introduction\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eServices: Service cards with scope and timelines\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProcess: Four step journey from research to handoff\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePricing: Tiered project pricing with clear inclusions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTestimonials: Client quotes mapped to roles and companies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlog: CMS essays on design and process\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact: Detailed inquiry form with project fields\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWho it\u0026#39;s for\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUX and product designers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFreelance designers and developers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIndependent creatives and studios\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAnyone showcasing case study driven work\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat\u0026#39;s in the package\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e25% off Framer Pro\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eVideo tutorials\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFree email support\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePersonal and commercial use\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://contra.com/payment-link/O2fsad98-lunis-design-all-access-framer-lifetime-package\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAll-Access for $249\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eGet every Framer template from Lunis Design today and every future release, all for a single one-time payment. \u003ca href=\"https://lunisdesign.com/framer-templates\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eSee full collection.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhat’s included:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAll current Framer templates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAll future releases\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePartner templates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCommercial license for unlimited projects\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFigma versions available for select templates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e7d:Tab1,\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImpact Flow – Social Media Marketing Agency Framer Template\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eImpact Flow is a clean, modern, and high-converting Framer template designed for social media marketing agencies, digital growth studios, content creators, and performance-driven marketing teams that want to present their services with confidence, clarity, and strong visual impact.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt with a focus on modern interactions, smooth animations, and conversion-focused layouts, Impact Flow helps agencies showcase their expertise through engaging sections, bold presentation, and a clean user experience without unnecessary complexity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS-powered Blog \u0026amp; Case Studies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eModern and smooth Framer animations\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClean, minimal, and conversion-focused layouts\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFully responsive for desktop, tablet, and mobile\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSEO-friendly structure and optimized performance\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDedicated service and case study pages\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTestimonial sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStrong call-to-action sections for lead generation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy no-code customization\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProfessional hero sections and modern footer layouts\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFree editable Figma file included\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLaunch a professional agency website quickly with a ready-to-use structure that can be customized and published in a short time.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePages Overview\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHome\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eServices\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eService Details\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCase Studies (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCase Study Details\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlog (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlog Details\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAbout\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTerms \u0026amp; Conditions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUtility Pages\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e404 (Not Found)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eComing Soon\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePassword Protected\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFree editable Figma file included\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAfter purchasing the template, you will automatically receive the editable Figma file included with the template.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization \u0026amp; Support\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeel free to reach out anytime at \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"mailto:hello@artificerdesign.agency\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ehello@artificerdesign.agency \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- or DM at \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/zahidul-ui/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLinkedIn\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e / \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://x.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ex.com\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e - personally assist every buyer.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e7e:T4c0,\u003cp\u003eInspired by Swiss design principles and a disciplined grid system, it focuses on balance, hierarchy, and precision.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt for agencies, creative studios, consultants, and individuals, Das Studio offers a neutral yet confident visual language that adapts easily to different industries. Its structured layouts and restrained typography create a calm, professional tone—making it ideal for showcasing services, projects, and portfolios without visual clutter.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDas Studio provides a flexible, well-organized base that scales with your needs while maintaining a consistently clean and professional look.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClean, Swiss-inspired design with a strong grid system\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProfessional layout suitable for agencies, portfolios, and business websites\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo-code customization — built entirely with native Framer tools\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS-powered Projects, Journal, and Legal pages for easy content management\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eThoughtful spacing and typography for clear visual hierarchy\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustomizable fonts and color styles to match your brand\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully responsive design that stays sharp and structured on all devices\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e7f:Ta66,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHomy is the #1 modern real estate website template for Framer, built for real estate agencies, realtors, property dealers, brokers, and property management companies who want to showcase luxury homes and sell properties faster. No coding required.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHomy is a premium, fully responsive real estate template that helps you launch a professional property website in minutes. Whether you list residential homes, luxury villas, commercial real estate, apartments, or new construction projects, Homy presents every property with clarity, impact, and conversion focused design.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"house_with_garden\"\u003e🏡\u003c/span\u003e Perfect For:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eReal estate agencies and brokerages\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRealtors, estate agents, and property dealers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProperty management and property listing platforms\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLuxury villa, apartment, and residential home showcases\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCommercial and residential real estate\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNew construction and property development projects\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInterior design and architecture studios\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMortgage brokers, property investors, and rental businesses\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"sparkles\"\u003e✨\u003c/span\u003e Key Features:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClean, modern, and premium real estate design that builds instant trust\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully responsive layout that works perfectly on desktop, tablet, and mobile\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt in CMS to add, edit, and manage property listings visually with zero code\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStructured property detail pages for photos, pricing, location, and key features\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eReusable components and smooth animations for a high end feel\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSEO ready structure so your real estate website ranks and loads fast\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy to customize, match your brand in a few clicks, and scale as you grow\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"page_facing_up\"\u003e📄\u003c/span\u003e Pages Included:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHome\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProperties (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProperty Detail (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eServices\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAbout\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e404\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"rocket\"\u003e🚀\u003c/span\u003e Why Homy:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eUnlike generic business templates, Homy is purpose built for real estate. Every section, from the property listings grid to the agent contact form, helps agencies, realtors, and property managers turn visitors into buyers and leads. Launch a real estate agency website, property listing platform, or luxury home showcase without hiring a developer.\u003c/p\u003e80:T865,\u003cp\u003eAgenciy is a modern Creative \u0026amp; Digital Agency Framer template designed for agencies that want to launch a professional, conversion-focused website without starting from scratch.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt for creative agencies, digital agencies, marketing agencies, design studios, branding agencies, web agencies, and development studios, Agenciy provides everything you need to showcase your services, projects, expertise, and results while turning visitors into potential clients.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose Agenciy?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAgenciy combines bold, modern design with a conversion-focused structure built around real agency needs. Showcase your services, case studies, testimonials, team, and work through carefully designed sections that clearly communicate what you do and why clients should choose you.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvery page is fully responsive and easy to customize in Framer, allowing you to quickly adapt the colors, typography, imagery, and content to match your brand.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eModern creative agency design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully responsive across desktop, tablet, and mobile\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS-powered projects and blog\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eServices and case study sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTestimonials and social proof\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact forms\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSmooth animations and scroll effects\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustom interactions and cursor effects\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePremium typography\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy Framer customization\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConversion-focused layouts\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect For\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreative Agencies • Digital Agencies • Marketing Agencies • Design Studios • Branding Agencies • Web Design Agencies • Development Studios • Creative Businesses\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLive Preview\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://agenciy.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://agenciy.framer.website/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMore Premium Templates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.framer.com/@nframe/?tab=template\u0026amp;sort=popular\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://www.framer.com/@nframe/?tab=template\u0026amp;sort=popular\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e81:Ta4e,\u003cp\u003eArcSphere Studio\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"registered\"\u003e®\u003c/span\u003e | Modern Architecture Portfolio\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"link\"\u003e🔗\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://arcsphere-studio.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePreview Here\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eArcSphere Studio is a premium architecture Framer template designed for architects, interior designers, landscape studios, urban planners, and creative firms that want a refined online presence.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFeaturing minimalist layouts, immersive project showcases, CMS-powered case studies, premium animations, and a fully responsive experience, it\u0026#39;s built to present your work with clarity, professionalism, and impact—without writing code.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eKey Features\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMinimal architecture-inspired design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eImmersive project showcases\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS-powered portfolio \u0026amp; case studies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePremium animations \u0026amp; micro-interactions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully responsive across all devices\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo-code customization\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOrganized components\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerformance optimized\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003ePerfect For\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eArchitects, architecture studios, interior designers, landscape architects, urban planners, luxury real estate developers, design consultancies, creative agencies, and freelance design professionals.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhat\u0026#39;s Included\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e25% OFF Framer Yearly Plan Promo Code\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFREE Lifetime Updates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully Responsive Design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS-Powered Projects \u0026amp; Case Studies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePremium Animations \u0026amp; Micro-Interactions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOrganized Components \u0026amp; Easy Customization\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePremium Email Support (including live call/video guidance)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eOptional Customization Available\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eNeed help getting started? A \u003cstrong\u003eCustomization Plan\u003c/strong\u003e is available at checkout, including branding setup (logo, colors, fonts), content replacement, and website publishing using the assets you provide.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePlease note that this service \u003cstrong\u003edoes not include\u003c/strong\u003e redesigning existing sections, adding new sections or pages, custom development, or changing the template\u0026#39;s layout or functionality. Any additional custom work is quoted separately.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eRefund Policy\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eDue to the nature of digital products, \u003cstrong\u003eall purchases are final and non-refundable\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSupport\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003ePremium email support is included with every purchase.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEmail:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"mailto:contact@firstframe.agency\"\u003econtact@firstframe.agency\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e82:T95f,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://mirastudio.framer.website/?utm_source=framer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eLive preview\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eMira is an editorial template for studios that refuse to blend in. Built around a simple fiction: a small, personality-led studio where clients talk directly to the maker. Quiet copy, huge display type, a single red accent, work that does the talking.\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePowered by WebGL\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThree custom WebGL components give Mira motion you won\u0026#39;t find in other templates, with ten transition effects like Noise Warp, Liquid, and Dissolve built in. The fullscreen hero slider and project showcase run on your Projects CMS: add a project once and it shows up in the hero, the showcase, and its own page. Both play images or videos, ripple and bend as your cursor moves, and every effect adjusts with simple sliders. No code anywhere.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe preloader counts up while your site actually loads, then reveals the page through your own logo. Swap the logo, pick how it enters, done. Even the 404 turns your text into a 3D wireframe that shatters and swirls under the cursor.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://mirastudio.framer.website/404?utm_source=framer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eSee the 404 page in action\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEverything runs on the CMS\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFive connected collections power the whole site. Projects know their services, articles know their authors. Case studies come with image or video headers, galleries, results, and client quotes. Change something once and it updates everywhere it appears.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRich features\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA contact form that reads like a conversation and confirms your message arrived. A pricing calculator your visitors can actually use: tick add-ons, the total updates live. And the demo content is fully written, so you\u0026#39;re editing a working site instead of staring at empty boxes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHeavily documented\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou\u0026#39;re never customizing alone. A user guide and style guide sit right on the canvas, and the customization guide comes with ready-made AI prompts: restyle Mira by telling an agent what you want.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContact\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eQuestions? \u003ca href=\"mailto:joseph@launchnow.design\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ejoseph@launchnow.design\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eMost templates are a layout you fill in. Mira is a point of view with an engine under it.\u003c/h2\u003e83:T8eb,\u003ch2\u003eNYRO® Framer template was crafted for creatives who want their portfolio to stand out with clarity, personality, and modern flair.\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned with gradient-inspired visuals and bold typography, it provides a sleek structure that highlights your projects while keeping the focus on your skills and creativity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhat makes NYRO® different?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e🎨 \u003cstrong\u003eCreative Impact\u003c/strong\u003e – Gradient accents and smooth animations make your portfolio memorable.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✨ \u003cstrong\u003eClarity \u0026amp; Focus\u003c/strong\u003e – A clean layout ensures your work, not the interface, takes center stage.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🚀 \u003cstrong\u003eConversion Ready\u003c/strong\u003e – Thoughtful CTAs guide visitors toward inquiries and collaborations.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e📐 \u003cstrong\u003eFlexible Structure\u003c/strong\u003e – Built with modular sections for easy customization.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/55849-nyro-XVZVIkA8nLcx12fkqiZxC4LjaRLhMO\" alt=\"Easy to customize feedback cards \"\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003eEasy to customize feedback cards \u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp\u003eNYRO® is built in Framer for seamless performance, SEO-friendly structure, and quick, frustration-free setup.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you’re a freelancer, designer, or creative studio, this template gives you the stage to present your work with confidence and style.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhat’s Included:\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e7 professionally designed pages\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStep-by-step video guide\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e3 months of Framer Pro\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLifetime updates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmail support\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003ePages:\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHome\u003c/strong\u003e – A bold, portfolio-first landing page.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProjects (CMS)\u003c/strong\u003e – Showcase your work with a clean, flexible grid.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e\u0026amp; Contact \u003c/strong\u003e– Share your story and contacts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBlog (CMS)\u003c/strong\u003e – Publish insights and updates with ease.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLegal Pages – Everything you need for a professional, complete site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eContacts\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eReach out via \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://x.com/ytsyhanenko\"\u003ex.com\u003c/a\u003e or email \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:hello@tvorbadesign.com\"\u003ehello@tvorbadesign.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e84:T4cc,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://td-maxfolio.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLive Preview\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://volt.supply/templates/maxfolio\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTemplate Details\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eBuilt to Highlight Work and Skill\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaxfolio is designed for digital, branding, product, and motion designers, as well as all creative individuals.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt is minimal, bold where necessary, and focuses on your work and skills without the fluff. The layout is bold and high-contrast, available in both light and dark modes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eDesigned for\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct designers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBranding and graphic designers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUX/UI designers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePhotographers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eVisual and creative artists\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVisit \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://volt.supply/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVolt Supply\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e for more templates and resources.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeel free to contact me at \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"mailto:hello@volt.supply\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ehello@volt.supply\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e if you have any questions or feedback.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e85:T872,\u003ch2\u003eThe Best Videography Video Portfolio Framer Template for Videographer, Video Editor and Video Services.\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://video-folio.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLive Preview\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA professional video portfolio website designed for videographer portfolio, filmmaker portfolio, cinematographer portfolio, video editor portfolio, directors, 3D artist portfolio, motion graphic designer portfolio, animator portfolio, VFX artists, photographers, creative agencies, production companies, and video production studios. This modern portfolio template gives visual creators a professional space to showcase selected work, featured projects, showreels, case studies, creative services, client testimonials, and project details.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe flexible portfolio layout is ideal for a videographer portfolio, filmmaker portfolio, cinematographer portfolio, video editor portfolio, director portfolio, 3D artist portfolio, motion graphic designer portfolio, motion designer portfolio, animator portfolio, VFX artist portfolio, photographer portfolio, creative studio portfolio, production company portfolio, and video production studio portfolio.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt for freelance videographers, independent filmmakers, professional cinematographers, video editors, 3D designers, CGI artists, motion designers, visual effects artists, creative directors, production houses, animation studios, film studios, and full-service video production companies, this creative portfolio website helps every project look polished, organized, and memorable.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShowcase your professional experience, creative process, portfolio projects, recent work, featured work, selected projects, project galleries, showreels, client collaborations, awards etc.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis video portfolio template is suitable for personal portfolios, freelance portfolios, studio portfolios, agency portfolios, creative portfolios, filmmaker websites, videographer websites, cinematographer websites, motion design websites, 3D artist websites, animation studio websites, production company websites, and video production studio websites.\u003c/p\u003e86:T44c,\u003cp\u003eIntroducing Billie – an immersive Framer website design created to help your agency or personal portfolio shine. Billie combines a clean, stylish \u0026amp; modern layout with a professional feel, offering the ideal space to present your work. Fully customizable, this template allows you to effortlessly match it to your brand’s unique style. Whether you're a creative agency, freelancer, or photographer, Billie provides a versatile platform to showcase your projects and successes. With smooth animations, responsive design, and an intuitive interface, Billie delivers a captivating user experience on any device. Make a bold statement with the Billie Portfolio Template and impress your audience with its seamless design.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSleek and Sophisticated Design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMouseover immersive effects\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eResponsive Layout\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInteractive Elements\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSmooth scroll using Lenis\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eAre you ready to unleash the power of your services? Impress your audience, and redefine what's possible with Billie.\u003c/p\u003e87:T9ac,\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"link\"\u003e🔗\u003c/span\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eFull Live Preview:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://agero.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://agero.framer.website/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"sparkles\"\u003e✨\u003c/span\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eMore Premium Templates:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://www.framer.com/@nframe/?tab=template\u0026amp;sort=popular\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://www.framer.com/@nframe/?tab=template\u0026amp;sort=popular\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAgero\u003c/strong\u003e is a modern AI agency Framer template built for businesses that want a professional, conversion-focused agency website. Whether you\u0026#39;re running an AI agency, digital agency, creative agency, marketing agency, automation agency, technology agency, consulting agency, branding agency, startup agency or SaaS agency.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned with modern agency needs in mind, this agency template combines clean layouts, smooth interactions, and strategic content sections to showcase agency services, agency solutions, agency expertise, agency projects, agency works, and agency results. Each agency page is crafted to help an agency show value clearly \u0026amp; convert visitors into clients.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose Agero?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA successful agency needs more than great design. Agero provides a complete agency framework that helps an agency present services, agency achievements, display agency testimonials, and strengthen agency credibility. The responsive agency layout ensures a seamless experience across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices, while optimized agency structure keeps your website fast and engaging agency site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eModern AI agency design, responsive agency layout, smooth agency interactions, fast-loading agency performance, scalable agency sections, premium agency typography, flexible agency customization, and conversion-focused agency.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect For\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI Agency, Digital Agency, Creative Agency, Marketing Agency, Technology Agency, Automation Agency, Startup Agency, Consulting Agency, Branding Agency, Design Agency, Development Agency, Web Agency, Software Agency, Growth Agency, SEO Agency, Content Agency, Media Agency, SaaS Agency, Innovation Agency, Enterprise Agency, AI Agency, Digital Agency, Creative Agency, Marketing Agency, Technology Agency, Automation Agency, Startup Agency, Consulting Agency.\u003c/p\u003e88:T556,\u003cp\u003ePaperline is a portfolio template for designers and creative professionals who want to present their work in a clean, distinctive, and well-structured way. It combines an editorial layout with blueprint/engineering visual details, spacious composition, and polished case study presentation to create a personal site that feels both professional and memorable.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe template is designed to help you showcase projects, introduce yourself clearly, and build a stronger visual identity online. It works especially well for product designers, UI/UX designers, digital creatives, art directors, and other professionals who want a portfolio with more character than a standard minimal layout.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePaperline features a strong landing section, carefully framed project previews, balanced typography, soft rounded containers, and mobile-ready screens that preserve the same visual quality across devices. The overall style feels modern, thoughtful, and slightly technical without becoming cold or overly complex.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt is easy to customize and adapt to your own practice. You can quickly replace images, edit text, update case studies, adjust colors, and shape the template around your personal style or professional focus.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you are building a first portfolio or refreshing an existing one, Paperline offers a solid and expressive starting point.\u003c/p\u003e89:Tc74,\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLimited-Time Offer: 30% off at checkout!\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://plumbzo.framer.website\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eCheck Preview here \u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"arrow_upper_right\"\u003e↗\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFREE Bonus Included ($150 Value)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlumbzo\u003c/strong\u003e includes exclusive resources to help you launch your site faster and achieve better results.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTemplate Instruction Guide\u003c/strong\u003e – Complete walkthrough for customising every section of the template.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeginner\u0026#39;s Framer Guide\u003c/strong\u003e – Perfect for users who are new to Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSEO Guide\u003c/strong\u003e – Learn how to write effective meta titles, meta descriptions, and implement JSON-LD schema for improved search visibility.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eAbout Plumbzo\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlumbzo\u003c/strong\u003e is a premium Framer template built for plumbing companies, contractors, and home service businesses looking to establish a professional online presence. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA High converting landing page, reusable components, and a modern design system, it helps showcase services, build trust, and generate more enquiries. \u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eTemplate Features\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePremium plumber website design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully responsive\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConversion-focused landing page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProfessional service showcase sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTestimonials \u0026amp; customer reviews\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eService area section\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFeatured projects showcase\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFAQ section\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmergency call-to-action sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLegal pages like privacy policy, terms, refund policy, etc\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy no-code customisation\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cl