lable format.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAbout – Share your team’s story and mission with clarity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlog (CMS) – Publish updates, insights, or case studies with ease\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e8e:T641,\u003ch2\u003eOverview:\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrecept is a modern, minimal Framer template for robotics, manufacturing, and industrial companies. Clean, technical, and built to scale — made for teams that actually make things, and want a site that looks like it.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRobotics \u0026amp; automation companies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdvanced \u0026amp; contract manufacturers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIndustrial \u0026amp; engineering firms\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSystem integrators\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAerospace, automotive, logistics \u0026amp; energy suppliers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHardware \u0026amp; hardtech startups\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e15+ reusable custom components\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eModern, minimal industrial design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrecise grid system, built to scale\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMono + sans type system\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully responsive across all breakpoints\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS-powered throughout\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSmooth, purposeful interactions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClean, reusable styles \u0026amp; components\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSEO-ready structure\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded pages:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHome\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAbout\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCapabilities + Capability detail\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNewsroom + Article detail\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCareers + Position detail\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrivacy\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eChangelog\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e404\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat\u0026#39;s inside the CMS:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCapabilities — reusable detail layout\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNewsroom — case studies \u0026amp; articles\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOpen Positions — full careers section\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e8f:T688,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMessage\u003c/strong\u003e is a sleek and conversion-focused Framer template crafted for AI products, generative assistants, and language model launches. Whether you’re introducing a new AI companion, showcasing a smart productivity tool, or teasing the next big model release, Message gives you the perfect starting point to capture attention and drive adoption.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith its modular layout, refined UI mockups, and strong value messaging, this template is designed to resonate with innovators, early adopters, and modern SaaS founders. Every section is built for clarity and flow, helping you turn visitors into engaged users.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt on a flexible structure, Message adapts seamlessly to different use cases — from AI-powered productivity apps to large-scale LLM unveilings.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI companions \u0026amp; chatbots\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGenerative assistants \u0026amp; tools\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSaaS founders launching AI-powered products\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIndie makers building solo AI projects\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTech startups showcasing AI research\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLLM \u0026amp; sub-model releases\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFramer users creating AI/tech landing pages\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick fix for early users\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you duplicated the template before \u003cstrong\u003eMarch 9, 2026\u003c/strong\u003e, you may notice the mobile navigation opening when clicking desktop links.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis can be fixed by changing the \u003cstrong\u003eOverlay → Show On\u003c/strong\u003e setting to \u003cstrong\u003eOpen Mobile Navigation\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/56203-message-TkULgHaEyhvPR590w9V6Pkc7VhrG7g\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e90:T675,\u003cp\u003eStrand is a premium Framer template designed for AI platforms, analytics tools, and data-heavy products that need to walk visitors from raw data to a clear answer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdapt every section to fit your brand\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResponsive design\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTested across desktop, tablet, and mobile\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCMS-powered pages\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eUpdate blog posts, changelog entries, job postings, integrations and more with ease\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGuide\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWalkthrough of the more complex custom components we built\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCustom components library\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvery component is reusable and restyleable\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWebGL components\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIncludes customizable WebGL components, easily adaptable to your brand\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://youtu.be/xZPC-HHE0x4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eWebGL Component Demo Video\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes 16 unique pages:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHomepage\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFeatures pages (3 versions)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIntegrations (CMS index)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIntegration page (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePricing (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCareers (CMS index)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCareer page (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eChangelog (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAbout us\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlog (CMS index)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlog page (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact us\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLegal pages (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e404 page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContact\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHave questions regarding the template? Reach out to us at \u003ca href=\"mailto:support@kreativnik.eu\"\u003esupport@kreativnik.eu\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e91:T919,\u003cp\u003eTITARVL is a refined portfolio template built for designers and creatives who want their work to speak clearly and confidently. Designed with a strong focus on typography, layout, and visual balance, it provides a powerful foundation for showcasing web design, UI/UX, branding, and digital projects in a modern, minimal way.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe template is ideal for freelancers, digital designers, creative studios, and agencies looking to present their work without distractions. Its clean structure and type-driven approach keep attention exactly where it belongs — on the projects. Every section is carefully considered to highlight your work, process, and experience with clarity and intention.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you’re launching your first portfolio or evolving an existing one, TITARVL offers a flexible and elegant system that adapts to your content while maintaining a strong visual identity. Built for professionals who value precision, simplicity, and strong presentation, it helps create a lasting impression on clients and collaborators.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you’re serious about presenting your work at a high level, TITARVL is designed to elevate your portfolio and define your digital presence.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFree customization tutorial\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvery purchase includes a full walkthrough video, hosted right on my website. It walks you through customizing every part of the template, connecting your own domain, and publishing your site, so you\u0026#39;re never stuck figuring things out on your own.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eClick here to access \u003ca href=\"https://titarvldesign.framer.website/works/titarvl\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eFree Customization Tutorial\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully responsive design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS-powered works and project detail pages\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClean, minimal layout system\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSmooth animations and interactions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy customization in Framer\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e8 pages included\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustom 404 page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrivacy and cookies policy pages ready\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePages\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHome\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAbout\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWorks (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProject Detail (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e404 page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCookies Policy\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e92:T598,\u003ch3\u003eBureau Nine — Minimal Creative Agency \u0026amp; Portfolio Framer Template\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLive Preview:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://bureaunine.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://bureaunine.framer.website/\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBureau Nine is a calm, editorial, fully responsive Framer template built for creative studios and independent designers who let the work speak. It pairs generous whitespace with a CMS-driven case study system that makes every project feel like an edition and it works just as well as a personal portfolio for graphic designers and creative directors, so you can run it as a studio site or as your own body of work.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerfect for\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreative studios and boutique agencies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGraphic designers building a personal portfolio\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreative directors presenting selected work\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBrand identity and packaging designers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eArt directors and motion designers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFreelance creatives launching a first studio site\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhat\u0026#39;s inside\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you\u0026#39;re presenting a handful of signature projects or a growing body of client work, Bureau Nine gives you a refined, quietly confident home for your portfolio with detailed project pages, an about story, and a direct contact flow.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSupport:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"mailto:hello@soleno.io\"\u003ehello@soleno.io\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e93:T9e2,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://firma-template.framer.website/\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLive preview\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFirma — A modern Framer template for creative agencies, studios, and design-led teams.\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt on a clean horizontal scroll experience, \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://firma-template.framer.website/\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFirma\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e is more than just a portfolio — it’s a storytelling platform. Designed for studios that care about craft, clarity, and creative impact, it helps you showcase your work, your team, and your process with confidence.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhy choose Firma?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHorizontal Layout, Done Right.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA unique scroll experience that feels fresh, intuitive, and memorable — designed to guide your audience through your story.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMinimal Design, Maximum Impact.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo clutter, no fluff. Just beautifully structured content, smart typography, and space for your work to breathe.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCMS-Powered Flexibility.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eProjects, articles, testimonials — all managed through Framer’s powerful CMS. Update your site anytime, without touching a line of code.\u2028\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEverything You Need, Nothing You Don’t.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFrom project case studies to pricing plans, team bios to your creative process — Firma includes all the essentials, thoughtfully organized and easy to tailor.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWho it’s for:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesign studios, branding agencies, digital creatives, and freelancers looking for a sleek, client-ready web presence that performs as beautifully as it looks.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat’s inside:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHome – Showcase your mission, latest work, services, pricing, achievements, and more\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProjects (CMS) – Present your case studies with a flexible layout\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAbout / Studio – Share your story, introduce the team, highlight recognitions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eJournal (CMS) – Publish insights, updates, and behind-the-scenes content\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact – Invite collaboration with a clear, well-structured contact page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFully responsive. Built for performance. Easy to edit.\u003c/strong\u003eWhether you’re launching a new agency or evolving your current site, \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://firma-template.framer.website/\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFirma\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e gives you a solid, stylish foundation — and all the tools you need to make it your own.\u003c/p\u003e94:Tb4b,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMacxfolio\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"registered\"\u003e®\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e | Premium macOS Portfolio Framer Template\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreate a memorable portfolio with \u003cstrong\u003eMacxfolio\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"registered\"\u003e®\u003c/span\u003e, a premium Framer portfolio template inspired by the iconic macOS experience. Designed for designers, developers, creatives, freelancers, and agencies, it transforms your portfolio into an immersive desktop-inspired website with modern animations, interactive elements, and a polished glassmorphism interface. Showcase projects, blogs, resources, resume, and personal information through a unique browsing experience while maintaining excellent performance, responsiveness, and SEO.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"sparkles\"\u003e✨\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e Key Features\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAuthentic macOS-inspired desktop interface\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInteractive macOS Dock\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInteractive desktop experience\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustomizable playful pet cursor\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLive Cat Herding mini game\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt-in music player\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS-powered Projects\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS-powered Blog\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS-powered Resources\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eResume page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAbout page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMovies \u0026amp; Series section\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eModern Glassmorphism UI\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSmooth page transitions \u0026amp; overlays\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePremium animations \u0026amp; micro-interactions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully responsive across all devices\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSEO-friendly structure\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGlobal styles \u0026amp; reusable components\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClean, organized component system\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFast, no-code customization\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt with Framer best practices\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect For\u003c/strong\u003e Designers • UI/UX Designers • Product Designers • Developers • Freelancers • Creative Professionals • Agencies • Students • Personal Brands\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLive Preview\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://macxfolio.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://macxfolio.framer.website/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"envelope_with_arrow\"\u003e📩\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e Support\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNeed help or have questions?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEmail: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"mailto:contact@firstframe.agency\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003econtact@firstframe.agency\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThank you for choosing Creatie\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"registered\"\u003e®\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e. We can\u0026#39;t wait to see what you build! \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLicense\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eValid for \u003cstrong\u003eone or more personal, commercial, or client website\u003c/strong\u003e. You may customize the template for your own projects, but you may \u003cstrong\u003enot\u003c/strong\u003e resell, redistribute, share, or repackage the template, modified or unmodified.\u003c/p\u003e95:T727,\u003cp\u003eLive preview: \u003ca href=\"https://sevora.framer.website\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003esevora.framer.website\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSevora is a free Framer portfolio template for independent designers, freelancers, and creative studios who want to present their work with clarity and confidence.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt around a refined minimal style, Sevora gives you a complete foundation for showcasing projects, explaining your services, sharing your process, and turning visitors into potential clients.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhat’s included:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Project and case study layouts • CMS-powered projects and articles • Services and integrations sections • Process and experience sections • Pricing, testimonials, and FAQ • About and contact pages • Responsive desktop, tablet, and mobile layouts • Smooth scrolling and subtle interactions • Easy-to-edit colors, typography, and content.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSevora is designed to be simple to customize. Replace the demo content, add your projects through the CMS, adjust the global styles, and publish a professional portfolio without starting from scratch.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLatest update:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdded a new integrations service\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdded AnimatedNumber for statistics\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRefined typography and spacing\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdded subtle background line patterns\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eImproved smooth scrolling and interactions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUpdated the tab navigation on the Projects and Article 2 pages for clearer states and a more consistent browsing experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdded Hero Section 02 as an alternative homepage hero layout, plus updated Style Guidelines for easier customization and better visual consistency.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdded left button icons, refreshed typography, and improved overall spacing, balance, and visual consistency across Sevora.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e96:Tb9c,\u003cp\u003eOcha is a bold and expressive Framer template designed for modern matcha cafés, specialty coffee shops, tea houses, bakeries, and creative food \u0026amp; beverage brands.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt with oversized typography, vibrant colors, immersive imagery, and playful interactions, Ocha transforms a traditional café website into a memorable digital experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"sparkles\"\u003e✨\u003c/span\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eKey Features\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"tea\"\u003e🍵\u003c/span\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eImmersive Single-Page Experience\u003c/strong\u003e A long-form homepage that brings your brand, menu, products, people, and community together.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"tropical_drink\"\u003e🍹\u003c/span\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eInteractive Menu \u0026amp; Specials\u003c/strong\u003e Showcase signature drinks, seasonal creations, and café favorites through bold, image-driven layouts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"film_strip\"\u003e🎞\u003c/span\u003e \u003cstrong\u003ePlayful Interactions\u003c/strong\u003e Smooth animations, expressive typography, and engaging visual experiences bring your website to life.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"busts_in_silhouette\"\u003e👥\u003c/span\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eTeam, Reviews \u0026amp; Community\u003c/strong\u003e Introduce your team, share customer stories, and promote workshops, pop-ups, and upcoming events.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"shirt\"\u003e👕\u003c/span\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eMerchandise Showcase\u003c/strong\u003e Promote apparel, packaged products, accessories, and branded merchandise.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"newspaper\"\u003e📰\u003c/span\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eCMS-Powered Articles\u003c/strong\u003e Publish stories, recipes, guides, announcements, and updates with Framer CMS.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"iphone\"\u003e📱\u003c/span\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eFully Responsive\u003c/strong\u003e Carefully optimized for desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"art\"\u003e🎨\u003c/span\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eEasy to Customize\u003c/strong\u003e Built with organized layers, reusable components, flexible layouts, and Framer best practices.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"page_facing_up\"\u003e📄\u003c/span\u003e \u003cstrong\u003ePages Included\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHome\u003c/strong\u003e — Featuring your brand story, specials, menu, reviews, team, merchandise, events, location, articles, FAQ, and more.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIdeas / Articles\u003c/strong\u003e — A CMS-powered hub for stories, recipes, guides, and updates.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eArticle Detail\u003c/strong\u003e — A flexible CMS-powered layout for long-form content.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"dart\"\u003e🎯\u003c/span\u003e \u003cstrong\u003ePerfect For\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMatcha cafés, specialty coffee shops, tea houses, bakeries, restaurants, beverage brands, and creative hospitality businesses.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"green_heart\"\u003e💚\u003c/span\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eWhy Ocha?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOcha is made for cafés that want more than a basic website. Bold typography, vibrant visuals, interactive layouts, and community-focused storytelling come together to create a memorable digital experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e97:T951,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHalo Studio\u003c/strong\u003e is a sleek, high-performance creative portfolio template built for designers, studios, freelancers, agencies, and digital creators who want to showcase their work with clarity and confidence. Designed with a modern aesthetic and smooth interactions, Halo Studio helps you present your brand, projects, and stories in a visually compelling way — without touching a single line of code.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you're launching a personal portfolio, a creative studio site, or a professional showcase, Halo Studio delivers speed, flexibility, and scalability out of the box.✨ Key Features\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e Clean, modern, and minimal UI design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e Fully responsive across desktop, tablet, and mobile\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e Built with Framer best practices for performance and SEO\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e Smooth animations and interactive components\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e Easy customization — change colors, fonts, layouts, and content instantly\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e CMS-powered Blog and Work sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e Optimized typography and spacing for readability\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e Lightweight structure for fast loading\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e Perfect for portfolios, agencies, startups, and creators\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e📄 Included Pages\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3\u003e Home\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eA strong hero section with clear messaging, featured projects, service highlights, testimonials, and call-to-action areas designed to convert visitors into clients.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e About\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eTell your story, introduce your team or brand vision, showcase your skills and experience, and build trust with potential clients.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eBlog\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eA CMS-powered blog layout for sharing insights, tutorials, news, and creative thoughts. Optimized for readability and engagement.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e Blog Details\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eBeautiful article layout with structured typography, images, and smooth scrolling for an excellent reading experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWork\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eShowcase your portfolio projects in a clean grid layout with filtering potential and visual focus.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWork Details\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eDedicated project case study pages to highlight project goals, challenges, process, and final results.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eContact\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eConversion-optimized contact section with form, social links, and a clear call-to-action to generate leads.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e 404 Page\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustom-designed error page to maintain brand consistency and user experience even when a page is missing.\u003c/p\u003e98:T860,\u003cp\u003eThe Foldex Framer template is a collage-inspired portfolio layout for designers, photographers, and creative studios who want their work to feel personal, not templated. Built around a flexible topic-based CMS, it helps you organize projects by category and present them with editorial texture and visual character. Fully responsive and easy to adapt, Foldex is designed to make your collected work — branding, campaigns, editorial, photography — feel like a cohesive body of work.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eKey Features\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTopic-based CMS for organizing work by category\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCollage-style visual layout with editorial rhythm\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt-in pages for pricing, testimonials, and about\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOptimized for SEO, accessibility, and performance\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e8 Pages\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHome\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePortfolio (Topics)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTopic Page (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePricing\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTestimonials\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAbout\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e404\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhat\u0026#39;s Included\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLifetime updates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmail support — \u003ca href=\"mailto:hello@tmpl.digital\"\u003ehello@tmpl.digital\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFull CMS setup, ready to use\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWorks on Framer Basic plan (from $10/mo)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eCan this be customized?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eYes — everything is editable directly on the Framer canvas. Colors, fonts, images, layouts — no coding needed.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eAny questions?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eReach out via \u003ca href=\"mailto:hello@tmpl.digital\"\u003ehello@tmpl.digital\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https://x.com/SashaMozdir\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eX\u003c/a\u003e, or \u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/Sasha.mozdir\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e — I\u0026#39;m happy to help.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://foldex.framer.website/?via=sashamozdir\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ePreview\u003c/a\u003e · \u003ca href=\"https://framer.link/xTN2cY3\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eDownload for free\u003c/a\u003e · \u003ca href=\"https://www.framer.com/@sashamozdir/?tab=marketplace\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eBrowse all templates\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e99:T4b1,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://maelle.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eLive Preview\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaelle\u003c/strong\u003e is an elegant portfolio template for designers, photographers, and creatives who value clarity and refinement. With clean layouts, smooth animations, and subtle typography, it places your work at the heart of the experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerfect for showcasing projects, case studies, or galleries, Maelle offers a minimal yet expressive framework that adapts seamlessly to your style, allowing your portfolio to make a lasting impression.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhat’s Included\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDetailed instructions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e3 months free of Framer Pro\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUse on unlimited projects\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e24-hour email support\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLifetime updates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose Maelle\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy customization\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully responsive\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e2 CMS collections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSleek \u0026amp; minimal design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSEO optimized\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerformance optimized\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eContact\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eFeel free to reach out if you have any questions: \u003ca href=\"mailto:thaerswailem@gmail.com\"\u003ethaerswailem@gmail.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e9a:T7bf,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://try-nocturna.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLive site →\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNocturna is a Framer marketing template for SaaS products of any kind — analytics, dev tools, fintech, productivity, infrastructure, whatever you\u0026#39;re building. Dark, monospace, built to feel technical and serious rather than soft and illustrative.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat makes Nocturna different\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eA full site, not just a landing page — 11 pages and 5 CMS collections covering product, pricing, blog, and legal, everything a SaaS company needs to launch\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eComplete pricing system: monthly/annual toggle with a savings callout, three pricing cards, and a full comparison table so buyers can check every plan detail before they commit\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS-powered blog, team, and legal pages — Privacy Policy, Terms of Service, and Cookie Policy content lives in the CMS, so updates never touch the design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eComplete customization guide included inside the Framer project\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI setup prompts included — generate content with your AI of choice, with automatic population available for supported tools\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePages included\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHome — hero, product walkthrough, how it works, testimonials, pricing, FAQ\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct — six feature blocks, each with an image and caption\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePricing — plan comparison table plus a billing FAQ\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAbout — company story, animated stats, team\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact — inquiry form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlog — CMS-powered post grid\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrivacy Policy, Terms of Service, Cookie Policy, 404\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt for\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAny SaaS product that needs a complete marketing site with pricing, blog, and legal pages already built, and wants the whole thing to read as technical and serious rather than soft and illustrative.\u003c/p\u003e9b:T8b6,\u003cp\u003eOverviewClipCut is a bold, dark-themed Framer template built for short-form video editing agencies and freelance editors. The design combines sharp visuals with a results-driven narrative — guiding visitors from problem to solution, showcasing real work, and converting them into paying clients. Every section is crafted to build trust fast and make it easy for creators and brands to take the next step.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003ePerfect For\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eShort-form video editing agencies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFreelance video editors \u0026amp; content creators\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSMMA owners offering video services\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContent studios targeting TikTok, Reels \u0026amp; Shorts\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSocial media managers with editing services\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUGC agencies \u0026amp; creator-focused brands\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eYouTube Shorts editors \u0026amp; producers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat's Included\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClean, dark-themed UI with modern typography\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully responsive across desktop \u0026amp; mobile\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy to customize sections and copy\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy to customize card UI animations\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003ePages and Sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHome\u003c/strong\u003e — A high-impact hero with social proof, a bold value proposition, and clear CTAs that immediately communicate what you do and who it's for.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProblem Section\u003c/strong\u003e — A visually engaging narrative that mirrors the visitor's frustration — low retention, inconsistent growth — before positioning your service as the fix.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow It Works\u003c/strong\u003e — A simple 3-step process (Send Clips → We Edit → Go Live) that removes friction and makes getting started feel effortless.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWork / Portfolio\u003c/strong\u003e page — A scrollable video showcase with real view counts and engagement stats, letting your results do the selling.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResults / Case Studies\u003c/strong\u003e — Client-specific outcomes with metrics (1.2M views, +10K followers, 3x engagement) that build credibility and social proof.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContact\u003c/strong\u003e — A clean enquiry form for potential clients to kick off a project, with no friction between interest and action.404 Page: Helps lost visitors find their way back instead of leaving your site.\u003c/p\u003e9c:Te03,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://veloxthemes.com/templates/platform/framer-templates?utm_source=framer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"arrow_upper_right\"\u003e↗\u003c/span\u003e Live preview\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://veloxthemes.com/templates/platform/framer-templates?utm_source=framer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"arrow_upper_right\"\u003e↗\u003c/span\u003e More Framer templates\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eAbout this template\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eYour agency needs more than a website. You need a platform that helps you win serious clients. Sanjaya is an AI agency Framer template built for teams that want to attract B2B and enterprise customers with a professional and trustworthy online presence.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you offer AI automation, AI consulting, or AI solutions for businesses, Sanjaya helps you present your services clearly and show the real value of your work. You can showcase services, highlight case studies, and explain your workflow in a way that builds trust with decision makers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLaunch your website faster and focus on growing your AI agency!\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eThis template is for you if you want to\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuild a modern website for your AI agency or AI automation agency\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAttract B2B and enterprise clients looking for AI solutions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eShowcase services like AI automation, workflow systems, and integrations\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuild trust with case studies and a clear process\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eYour benefits after purchase\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFigma file (Available on Standard+Figma and Extended+Figma)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStep-by-step tutorial on how to generate similar assets with Gemini and Kling 2.5\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e3 months of free Framer Pro annual plan\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e40% discount for your next purchase (Available on Extended+Figma)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFREE Lifetime updates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFast support\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHigh-quality template\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSEO Optimized\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrelaunch checklist\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSEO Booster with JSON-LD (Give search engines a better understanding of your page)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI search booster with llms.txt (Help AI models to understand your site fast)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHigh conversion copy machine (Our trained GPT, built to help you write copy that actually converts)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI Editing Kit (.md file + guide): edit with Claude, ChatGPT, or any external AI agent\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eTrusted by 1653+ creatives and entrepreneurs\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSee more \u003ca href=\"https://veloxthemes.com/testimonials?ref=marketplace\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003etestimonials and success stories\u003c/a\u003e on our website.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/52879-sadewa-2i4tNfjXVIVwATa0u1psbr4G3DZpX9\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/52879-sadewa-yNMlOkHTGVLWavM7NbWljwbLOH7ZLU\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/52879-sadewa-zURnX0S1ntbmzE6mBZRVPa9AdR8mnz\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch2\u003eSupport\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you have any questions, check out our FAQ or contact us at \u003ca href=\"mailto:info@veloxthemes.com\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003einfo@veloxthemes.com\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWe donate 1% of our profits to charity\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/52879-sadewa-X9ogTPyvHpD1240UjNPGUpUG15ESUk\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp\u003eRead more details on \u003ca href=\"https://veloxthemes.com/our-pledge\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eour pledge\u003c/a\u003e page.\u003c/p\u003e9d:T829,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://auton.framer.media/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eLive Preview\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAuton is a modern, premium Framer portfolio template crafted for freelancers, designers, developers, agencies, architects, and creative professionals who want a polished online presence. Built with performance, usability, and flexibility in mind, it makes creating a professional portfolio effortless.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned using proven portfolio best practices, Auton combines clean typography, thoughtful spacing, smooth interactions, and a fully responsive experience across every device. Whether you\u0026#39;re showcasing personal projects, client work, case studies, or services, Auton helps you present your work with confidence.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePerfect For\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ccode\u003eFreelancers\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ccode\u003eUI/UX Designers\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ccode\u003eWeb Designers\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ccode\u003eFront-end Developers\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ccode\u003eCreative Agencies\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ccode\u003eArchitects\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ccode\u003eDigital Creators\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ccode\u003eConsultants\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ccode\u003ePersonal Brands\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eModern \u0026amp; minimal design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully responsive across all devices\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProjects and case studies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSmooth page transitions and interactions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSEO-friendly structure\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFast loading and optimized performance\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy customization with no coding required\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOrganized components and styles\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProfessional contact section\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLifetime updates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eLaunch your portfolio faster with a template that focuses on what matters most—your work. Auton is built to help creative professionals establish credibility, impress clients, and grow their personal brand with a clean, high-performing website.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e✦ About the Designer\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eCrafted by \u003ca href=\"https://shreetechworld.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eShreetech\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eReach out us at \u003ca href=\"mailto:contact@shreetechworld.com\"\u003econtact@shreetechworld.com\u003c/a\u003e for more.\u003c/p\u003e9e:T75c,\u003cp\u003eForma Studio is a premium Framer template designed for interior designers, architects, creative studios, and design professionals who want a refined and modern online presence.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt with a minimal aesthetic and carefully structured layouts, Forma Studio helps showcase projects, services, studio expertise, and client trust in a clear and professional way. The template combines elegant visuals with thoughtful content sections, making it ideal for studios looking to present their work and attract new clients.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe homepage is designed around storytelling and credibility, featuring a bold hero section, studio introduction, services, featured projects, design process, testimonials, FAQs, and a conversion-focused contact experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhat\u0026#39;s Included\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Premium multi-page website design\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Home, About, Projects, and Contact pages\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Dynamic CMS-powered Projects Collection\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Automatically generated Project Detail Pages\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Team section for showcasing studio members\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Awards and recognition section\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Trusted by / credibility section\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Services section with custom service cards\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Featured projects showcase\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Interactive design process section\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Client testimonials\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• FAQ section\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Contact form and project inquiry page\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Privacy Policy and Terms \u0026amp; Conditions pages\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Responsive layout for desktop, tablet, and mobile\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Smooth animations and interactions\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Clean typography and spacing system\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Easy to customize in Framer\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003ePerfect For\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Interior Designers\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Architecture Studios\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Interior Architecture Firms\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Residential Design Studios\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Commercial Design Firms\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Creative Agencies\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Design Consultants\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Boutique Design Practices\u003c/p\u003e9f:T4fc,\u003cp\u003eVillo is a sleek, modern personal and portfolio template designed to make an impact. It features both dark and light mode with an easy toggle switch, allowing you to customize the look and feel to match your style. Villo is perfect for showcasing your work, skills, and achievements with a clean, minimalist design that puts content front and center.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis template includes the essential pages for a professional online presence:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eHome\u003c/strong\u003e: Welcome visitors with an engaging landing page.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eAbout\u003c/strong\u003e: Share your story, expertise, and personal details.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eWork\u003c/strong\u003e: Showcase your projects and highlight your portfolio.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eEducation\u003c/strong\u003e: Outline your academic background.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eExperience\u003c/strong\u003e: Present your professional history and achievements.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eWriting\u003c/strong\u003e: Share your thoughts and expertise through articles or blogs.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eContact\u003c/strong\u003e: Make it easy for others to reach out to you.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003e404\u003c/strong\u003e: A custom error page for a seamless user experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eVillo is perfect for creatives, developers, freelancers, and professionals looking to stand out with an elegant, fully responsive, and customizable portfolio website.\u003c/p\u003ea0:T8c4,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOptique\u003c/strong\u003e is a bold and thoughtfully crafted Framer template created for creative studios, design agencies, branding teams, and independent creatives who want their work to command attention.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt around expressive typography, immersive motion, and a refined editorial layout, Optique transforms your portfolio into a memorable digital experience. Every section is designed to communicate your studio’s personality, capabilities, and creative process with clarity and confidence.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShowcase selected projects, introduce your services, present pricing, explain your creative process, share testimonials, publish studio insights, and guide potential clients towards making an enquiry.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat’s Included\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStriking creative studio homepage \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDedicated portfolio and case-study pages \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eServices and pricing sections \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInteractive process presentation\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e Client testimonials \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStudio articles and insights\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e FAQs and contact experience \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully responsive layouts\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSmooth animations and polished interactions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you run a branding studio, digital agency, motion design practice, or multidisciplinary creative team, Optique gives you the structure and flexibility to create a portfolio that feels professional, distinctive, and unmistakably yours.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEverything can be customised directly inside Framer. Replace the content, images, colours, typography, and project details to match your studio identity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFor Customisation:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNeed help customising the template for your brand or business? View my portfolio and contact me here:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://ganesh.framer.media/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ehttps://ganesh.framer.media/\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRefund Policy:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs all our products are digital and delivered instantly, all sales are final and refunds are not available. Please review the product details carefully before purchasing, and contact us with any questions before completing your order.\u003c/p\u003ea1:T85b,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://torque.framer.media/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eLive Preview\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eStand out from first scroll and earn customer trust.\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eTorque is a premium Framer template designed for digital creative studios, agencies, and ambitious businesses that want their website to feel as thoughtful as the work they deliver. With a refined visual system, intentional layouts, and distinctive interactions, it helps you present your services, projects, and expertise with clarity while creating a strong first impression.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt with creative studios and agencies in mind, Torque is thoughtfully flexible enough for consulting firms, technology companies, professional services, and other modern businesses looking for a polished, high-converting online presence.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhat makes Torque stand out\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePremium, thoughtful design built to impress and build trust\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTwo distinctive hero sections for different brand directions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eScroll-based hero animation that creates an engaging first impression\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProject page with search and filters for easy portfolio discovery\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlog page with filtering to organize and showcase your insights\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDedicated services page with detailed service pages for deeper storytelling\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStructured layouts designed to communicate expertise and guide visitors toward action\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFlexible foundation that can be adapted beyond creative agencies and studios\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eEverything you need to build a credible digital presence\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvery detail in Torque is designed with intention — from the visual hierarchy and interactions to the way information is presented. Whether you\u0026#39;re running a creative studio, consulting business, or professional service, Torque gives you a premium foundation to look credible, communicate clearly, and convert more of the right visitors.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you need any help, feel free to reach out \u003ca class=\"mention\" data-type=\"mention\" data-id=\"59b1a783-b1b1-4d0c-8788-c0b9532ff9ec\" href=\"/community/creator/@aamir-saifi/\"\u003e@Aamir Saifi\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/p\u003ea2:Tc5c,\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"tada\"\u003e🎉\u003c/span\u003e Launch Offer\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGet 50% OFF — First 20 Customers Only\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"tickets\"\u003e🎟\u003c/span\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eUse Code:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ccode\u003eALEVWEB50\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"moneybag\"\u003e💰\u003c/span\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eRegular Price:\u003c/strong\u003e $89 \u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"fire\"\u003e🔥\u003c/span\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eLaunch Price:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e$44.50\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"gift\"\u003e🎁\u003c/span\u003e Your Purchase Includes\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"white_check_mark\"\u003e✅\u003c/span\u003e Framer Template\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"white_check_mark\"\u003e✅\u003c/span\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eFree Figma Source File\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully Responsive Design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS Blog Support\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSEO-Friendly Structure\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eLaunch your agency with confidence using \u003cstrong\u003eCrevix\u003c/strong\u003e, a premium minimal \u003cstrong\u003eDesign Agency Framer Template\u003c/strong\u003e crafted for creative agencies, digital studios, branding agencies, freelancers, startups, and modern businesses.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFeaturing clean layouts, elegant typography, smooth animations, and a conversion-focused user experience, Crevix helps you showcase your services, portfolio, team, and brand professionally. Every section is thoughtfully designed to deliver a premium browsing experience while remaining easy to customize using Framer\u0026#39;s visual editor—no coding required.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e✦ Why Choose Crevix\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e✦ Premium Minimal Design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e✦ Built for Creative Agencies \u0026amp; Studios\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e✦ Fully Responsive\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e✦ Easy to Customize\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e✦ CMS Blog Support\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e✦ Smooth Premium Animations\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e✦ SEO-Friendly Structure\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e✦ Fast Loading Performance\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e✦ Built with Framer Best Practices\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e✦ Pages Included\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e◈ Homepage\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e◈ About Us\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e◈ Services\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e◈ Service Details\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e◈ Projects\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e◈ Project Details\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e◈ Team Members\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e◈ Member Details\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e◈ Blog (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e◈ Blog Details\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e◈ Pricing\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e◈ Career\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e◈ Career Details\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e◈ Contact\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e◈ Privacy Policy\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e◈ Custom 404 Page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e✦ Perfect For\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreative Agencies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesign Agencies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDigital Agencies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBranding Studios\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUI/UX Designers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFreelancers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMarketing Agencies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreative Startups\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e✦ Need Customization?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eNeed help customizing \u003cstrong\u003eCrevix\u003c/strong\u003e for your business or brand?\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you need additional pages, custom features, CMS setup, or a fully customized website, feel free to get in touch.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"e-mail\"\u003e📧\u003c/span\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eEmail:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"mailto:alevwebcontact@gmail.com\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ealevwebcontact@gmail.com\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003ea3:T777,\u003ch2\u003eSWAG — A portfolio that does the talking for you\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSWAG is a minimal Framer portfolio template built for designers, artists, and creatives who want their work seen, not their website noticed.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eClean layout. Grid based. No noise. Just your projects on a stage that gets out of the way.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhat makes SWAG different?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt\u0026#39;s not just a template. It\u0026#39;s a full portfolio system built to flex across creative disciplines.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMinimal grid design: a clean layout that puts your work first, nothing competing for attention.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt for any creative field: works for designers, artists, agencies, photographers, whoever needs to show visual work.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS powered showcase: manage your projects through a built in CMS. Add, edit, or remove work without touching code.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLight theme: a bright, minimal look that keeps focus on the work.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSEO ready and fast: built on Framer for clean structure and quick load times.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFree customization tutorial\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvery purchase includes a full walkthrough video, hosted right on my website. It walks you through customizing every part of the template, connecting your own domain, and publishing your site, so you\u0026#39;re never stuck figuring things out on your own.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eClick here to access \u003ca href=\"https://titarvldesign.framer.website/works/swag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eFree Customization Tutorial\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePages included\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eCore pages\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHome\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWork (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAbout\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e404\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePolicies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures used\u003c/strong\u003e 3D Transforms, Appear Effects, CMS, Code Components, Custom Cursors, Forms, Layout Templates, Scroll Effects, Selection Styles, Slideshows/Tickers, Sticky Scrolling, Text Effects, Variable Fonts\u003c/p\u003ea4:T588,\u003ch2\u003eWho is this template for?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eIdeal for freelancers, solopreneurs, creators, producers, Rebirth delivers a professional Framer portfolio platform you need to present your best projects and case studies. You\u0026#39;ll enjoy a well-organized page structure, smooth animations, parallax transitions, smart components.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA quick start guide on the Canvas page is included and free lifetime updates.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWant even more?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eGet the \u003ca href=\"https://dub.sh/rebirth-checkout\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eRebirth Figma file\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_PIPVsPf0AlqLTO6DasVPQ4KHibQXi8dRvU2TD0RkeYS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eAll-Access for $299\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eGet instant access to every Framer template I’ve created with Extended Pro license including: \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNubo (NEW), Spector,  Vertical, Create\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"registered\"\u003e®\u003c/span\u003e, Platform, Arpeggio, Rescale and Rebirth.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe current template value is \u003cstrong\u003eover $1000\u003c/strong\u003e (with Extended Pro license including Figma files)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat’s included:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRemix links for all current templates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFigma source files for all templates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUnlimited domain usage (reuse on multiple domains)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e50% discount for all future templates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLifetime Update \u0026amp; Priority Support\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003ea5:T92d,\u003cp\u003eStackgrid is a premium, enterprise-grade Framer template engineered specifically for AI infrastructure agencies, systems architects, and technical consultancies. If you sell custom LLM deployments, RAG architectures, or complex data pipelines, your website needs to project absolute technical authority.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eStackgrid strips away the generic, colorful corporate fluff. It utilizes a strict, high-contrast aesthetic, razor-sharp typography, and smooth, purpose-driven scroll animations to position your firm as an elite engineering cell.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned for conversion, every section is strategically structured to guide enterprise buyers from initial infrastructure audits to high-value SLA engagements.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect For:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI Infrastructure Agencies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTechnical Consultancies \u0026amp; Systems Architects\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eData Engineering Firms\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHigh-Ticket B2B Enterprise Services\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBoutique Software Development Cells\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCore Features:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eComplete CMS Integration:\u003c/strong\u003e Effortlessly manage and publish complex Case Studies and Open Roles (Careers) without touching the canvas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePremium Framer Motion:\u003c/strong\u003e Fluid, scroll-based scrubbing animations and interactions that feel like a high-end native application.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConversion-Optimized Flow:\u003c/strong\u003e Strategically designed Service Tiers, Process Grids, and FAQ sections built specifically to sell phased engineering engagements.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e100% Responsive \u0026amp; Performant:\u003c/strong\u003e Pixel-perfect layouts that scale flawlessly across desktop, tablet, and mobile breakpoints.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eZero-Code Customization:\u003c/strong\u003e Built with Framer’s native components, colors \u0026amp; text styles for instant, seamless global theme updates.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePages Included:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHome (with Services, Process, and FAQ)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAbout (Company Manifesto \u0026amp; Team)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCase Studies Index (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCase Study (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCareers Index (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCareers (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact (Lead Capture)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e404 Custom Error Page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTerms \u0026amp; Conditions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAcceptable Use\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003ea6:T98d,\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTransform your portfolio into a nostalgic macOS desktop experience. \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"link\"\u003e🔗\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://macfolioo.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSee it live →\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMacfolio\u003c/strong\u003e is more than a portfolio template. It\u0026#39;s a fully interactive desktop inspired by the timeless charm of classic Macintosh computers. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvery window, icon, and interaction is designed to make your work feel memorable while keeping the experience clean, intuitive, and fun. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat makes Macfolio different: ‌\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✦ \u003cstrong\u003eCustomization Guide\u003c/strong\u003e — Includes easy-to-follow documentation and video tutorials to help you personalize every part of the template, from content and images to colors and projects. ‌\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✦ \u003cstrong\u003e25% Off Framer Pro\u003c/strong\u003e — Comes with an exclusive 25% discount code for Framer Pro, that’s the equivalent of \u003cstrong\u003e3 months free using\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✦ \u003cstrong\u003eBuilt-in Mini Game\u003c/strong\u003e — A nostalgic retro game is included to make your portfolio more interactive and memorable. ‌\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✦ \u003cstrong\u003eInteractive Portfolio Workspac\u003c/strong\u003ee — Showcase your work, resume, about page, services, overview, game   and contact information inside beautifully organized desktop windows instead of traditional web sections. ‌\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✦ \u003cstrong\u003ePixel-Perfect Retro Design\u003c/strong\u003e — Carefully crafted UI inspired by the iconic Macintosh aesthetic, combining vintage visuals with modern usability. ‌\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✦ \u003cstrong\u003eFully Responsive \u0026amp; Easy to Customize \u003c/strong\u003e— Personalize colors, content,a images, and projects in minutes with Framer\u0026#39;s visual editor. ‌\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✦ \u003cstrong\u003eFast \u0026amp; Lightweight\u003c/strong\u003e — Built with clean components, smooth animations, and optimized performance for an effortless browsing experience. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003ePAYMENT\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePayments can be made using digital wallets and \u003cem\u003ecryptocurrencies\u003c/em\u003e 𖹭\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003ePerfect for:\u003c/em\u003e Creative Directors ⋆ UI/UX Designers ⋆ Product Designers ⋆ Graphic Designers ⋆ Brand Designers ⋆Web Designers ⋆ Front-end Developers ⋆ Motion Designers ⋆ Digital Artists ⋆ Illustrators ⋆ Photographers ⋆ Creative Studios ⋆ Freelancers ⋆ Personal Portfolios ⋆ Creative Agencies.\u003c/p\u003ea7:T9bb,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://quantumflux.framer.ai/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePreview link\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout QuantumFlux\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eQuantumFlux is a product-first Framer template built for AI agencies, SaaS startups, and modern tech innovators. It helps you translate complex technologies into a compelling, system-driven interface with dynamic components and structured CMS collections. Your business is marketed as a premium through a combination of technical aesthetics, seamless micro-interactions, and fully responsive layouts. All you need to launch fast, look established, and scale efficiently in the AI era with QuantumFlux.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSome Core Features:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFully Customizable\u003c/strong\u003e – Change colors, fonts, and assets in seconds to suit your needs.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntegrated CMS\u003c/strong\u003e – 2 CMS collections on board by default, customizable, and optimized for the AI project.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e100% Responsiv\u003c/strong\u003ee – Mobile, tablet, and desktop optimized pixel-perfect layouts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePremium Animations\u003c/strong\u003e – Smooth, meaningful motion that demonstrates a high-quality digital product.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAll-in-One Structure\u003c/strong\u003e – Designed to match all AI Agency requirements perfectly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNo-Code Execution\u003c/strong\u003e – Built entirely in Framer so you can edit and deploy instantly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePages Included:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMain page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCases (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCase (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlog (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eArticle (CMS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact Us Page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCareer Page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAbout Us Page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTerms of Services\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLegal Entity\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e404 Page\u003c/p\u003e\u