ant a premium web presence without an agency budget\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Digital agencies \u0026 studios\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" looking for a client-ready base they can actually stand behind\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Tech platforms \u0026 infrastructure products\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" with complex offerings to showcase simply\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Going further — Extended Pro\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Select Extended Pro at \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"checkout \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"https://polar.sh/checkout/polar_c_ONIlUjgV3Fl8HfWOQPHcEVTpDzMWxLlOJYyIj1jW1Mv\",\"class\":null,\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"for:\"}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Unlimited Domains\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — Use the template across multiple client or personal projects.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Figma Source File\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — A fully layered, production-ready replica of the template.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Premium Lifetime Support\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — No chatbot. No ticket queue. No automated replies. Questions go directly to Tamas, the designer behind Platform.\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"All-Access for $299\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_PIPVsPf0AlqLTO6DasVPQ4KHibQXi8dRvU2TD0RkeYS\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Get instant access to every Framer template I’ve created with Extended Pro license including: \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Nubo (NEW), Spector, Vertical, Create\"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"registered\",\"emoji\":\"®\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", Platform, Arpeggio, Rescale and Rebirth.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The current template value is \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"over $1000\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (with Extended Pro license including Figma files)\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"What’s included:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Remix links for all current templates\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Figma source files for all templates\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Unlimited domain usage (reuse on multiple domains)\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"50% discount for all future templates\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Lifetime Update \u0026 Priority Support\"}]}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Modular SaaS \u0026 AI Landing Page\",\"slug\":\"platform\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId