 — Bartix ships it.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\" SaaS-Startup \u0026 SaaS Landing\",\"slug\":\"bartix\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"b764a613-a73c-4e1c-bee9-33b53ec67ce6\",\"name\":\"Framebite\",\"slug\":\"framebite\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/28800/PP-27rYF2tu8ZFD5L3sX1QQMlXq7ZkvMX.png\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/54831/bartix-xkpqGfPUz4d4YuNL7JXISes82AJpMU\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/54831/bartix-JgJDmjmmUVTVO4FvdQ98ntn9FSwTeN\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"0198c7f0-0792-76a9-862b-034c2fccbb30\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":163,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":13},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-08-09T08:21:44.365Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-28T10:21:22.648Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-08-20T14:44:13.330Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":\"2026-06-01T14:46:12.987Z\",\"type\":\"template\",\"attributes\":{\"price\":\"49\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://finestdevs.com/buy-bartix\",\"remixUrl\":null,\"previewUrl\":\"https://bartix.framer.website/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"SaaS\",\"slug\":\"saas\"},{\"id\":22,\"name\":\"Startup\",\"slug\":\"startup\"},{\"id\":14,\"name\":\"Landing Page\",\"slug\":\"landing-page\"}],\"styles\":[{\"id\":247,\"name\":\"Professional\",\"slug\":\"professional\"},{\"id\":109,\"name\":\"Modern\",\"slug\":\"modern\"},{\"id\":110,\"name\":\"Animated\",\"slug\":\"animated\"},{\"id\":111,\"name\":\"Minimal\",\"slug\":\"minimal\"},{\"id\":201,\"name\":\"Colorful\",\"slug\":\"colorful\"}],\"mainCategory\":{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"SaaS\",\"slug\":\"saas\"},\"features\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Appear Effects\",\"slug\":\"appear-effects\"},{\"id\":9,\"name\":\"Overlays \u0026 Modals\",\"slug\":\"overlays-modals\"},{\"id\":13,\"name\":\"Slideshows/Tickers\",\"slug\":\"slideshows-tickers\"},{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"Sticky Scrolling\",\"slug\":\"sticky-scrolling\"},{\"id\":18,\"name\":\"Scroll Effects\",\"slug\":\"scroll-effects\"},{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"CMS\",\"slug\":\"cms\"},{\"id\":30,\"name\":\"Forms\",\"slug\":\"forms\"},{\"id\":32,\"name\":\"Layout Templates\",\"slug\":\"layout-templates\"},{\"id\":35,\"name\":\"Text Effects\",\"slug\":\"text-effects\"},{\"id\":37,\"name\":\"Code Components\",\"slug\":\"code-components\"},{\"id\":39,\"name\":\"Selection Styles\",\"slug\":\"selection-styles\"},{\"id\":40,\"name\":\"Variable Fonts\",\"slug\":\"variable-fonts\"},{\"id\":41,\"name\":\"Vector Sets\",\"slug\":\"vector-sets\"}]}},{\"id\":\"61819\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"FintechX\",\"body\":\"$78\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Built for SaaS. Designed to Convert.\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"FintechX is a premium Framer template designed for modern finance platforms, from investment apps and trading tools to personal finance dashboards and fintech SaaS products. Built with conversion in mind, every section is structured to build trust immediately and push visitors toward action, whether that's signing up, exploring pricing, or connecting their existing tools.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The template ships as a fully structured, scroll-ready landing page that covers the complete buyer journey. It opens with a hero packed with social proof stats, moves through feature showcases and a live finance dashboard preview, then builds confidence with security messaging, real user testimonials, and a persona-based section that clearly communicates who the product is built for. \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"FintechX pairs a clean light UI with premium photography to create a look that feels both modern and trustworthy. In a space where credibility matters, the aesthetic does as much work as the copy.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Key Features\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Complete Landing Page\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" - Every section a finance or fintech product needs, in the right order, ready to go\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Data-Driven Dashboard UI\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" - Realistic finance dashboard mockups with charts, portfolio views, and transaction UIs\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Nature-Inspired Premium Design\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" - Light UI with organic photography accents that build trust on first impression\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"SEO Optimized\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" - Built with Framer's automated SEO tools and achieves a perfect 100/100 SEO score\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Page Speed Optimized - \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Built for fast loading and smooth performance across all devices.\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"What You Will Get After Purchase:\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"orderedList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Remix link for this Framer template\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Figma file of the template\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Coupon code for Free Framer Pro (annual plan) for 3 Months\"}]}]}],\"attrs\":{\"type\":null,\"start\":1}},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Best Suited For\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Fintech, investment platform, finance SaaS, personal finance app, stock trading, wealth management, financial dashboard, money management, finance startup, financial services, trading platform, fintech landing page, finance product launch, investment software\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Finance \u0026 Fintech SaaS Template\",\"slug\":\"fintechx\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"54a3bc64-c491-4d5b-9e64-b06174a71a50\",\"name\":\"Salim from Webestica\",\"slug\":\"webestica\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/28893/avatar-dXNbEFbLV5AqHMX9nTqBzuN9zLNO3i.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/54a3bc64-c491-4d5b-9e64-b06174a71a50/019f9461-7bdb-72be-984a-b714e9c8e5ef.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(77 70% 16%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/1Ad00B4xNffbSqV5G6TNGVGewgCznlBmfPj4pXyRyPF00.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/1Ad00B4xNffbSqV5G6TNGVGewgCznlBmfPj4pXyRyPF00/thumbnail.webp?time=3.533\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":6.033333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/61819/fintechx-m44Lvh7xBXF