tom WebGL components included. \"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":166,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":28},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-05T11:52:18.776Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-22T11:58:03.075Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-05T11:52:18.773Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-08-06T21:55:06.215Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"template\",\"attributes\":{\"price\":\"109\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_oOf3ONS93OAUW6lOFZ7UZscszE0BpDnNcB8DX1kY1E8\",\"remixUrl\":null,\"previewUrl\":\"https://strand.framer.website/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":26,\"name\":\"AI\",\"slug\":\"ai\"},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"SaaS\",\"slug\":\"saas\"},{\"id\":22,\"name\":\"Startup\",\"slug\":\"startup\"},{\"id\":112,\"name\":\"Technology\",\"slug\":\"technology\"},{\"id\":210,\"name\":\"Digital Products\",\"slug\":\"digital-products\"}],\"styles\":[{\"id\":110,\"name\":\"Animated\",\"slug\":\"animated\"},{\"id\":6,\"name\":\"3D\",\"slug\":\"3d\"},{\"id\":208,\"name\":\"Dark\",\"slug\":\"dark\"}],\"mainCategory\":{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"SaaS\",\"slug\":\"saas\"},\"features\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Appear Effects\",\"slug\":\"appear-effects\"},{\"id\":13,\"name\":\"Slideshows/Tickers\",\"slug\":\"slideshows-tickers\"},{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"Sticky Scrolling\",\"slug\":\"sticky-scrolling\"},{\"id\":18,\"name\":\"Scroll Effects\",\"slug\":\"scroll-effects\"},{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"CMS\",\"slug\":\"cms\"},{\"id\":30,\"name\":\"Forms\",\"slug\":\"forms\"},{\"id\":32,\"name\":\"Layout Templates\",\"slug\":\"layout-templates\"},{\"id\":36,\"name\":\"3D Transforms\",\"slug\":\"3d-transforms\"},{\"id\":37,\"name\":\"Code Components\",\"slug\":\"code-components\"},{\"id\":41,\"name\":\"Vector Sets\",\"slug\":\"vector-sets\"}]}},{\"id\":\"60169\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"TITARVL\",\"body\":\"$91\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"TITARVL is a refined portfolio template built for designers and creatives who want their work to speak clearly and confidently. Designed with a strong focus on typography, layout, and visual balance, it provides a powerful foundation for showcasing web design, UI/UX, branding, and digital projects in a modern, minimal way.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The template is ideal for freelancers, digital designers, creative studios, and agencies looking to present their work without distractions. Its clean structure and type-driven approach keep attention exactly where it belongs — on the projects. Every section is carefully considered to highlight your work, process, and experience with clarity and intention.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Whether you’re launching your first portfolio or evolving an existing one, TITARVL offers a flexible and elegant system that adapts to your content while maintaining a strong visual identity. Built for professionals who value precision, simplicity, and strong presentation, it helps create a lasting impression on clients and collaborators.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"If you’re serious about presenting your work at a high level, TITARVL is designed to elevate your portfolio and define your digital presence.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Free customization tutorial\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Every purchase includes a full walkthrough video, hosted right on my website. It walks you through customizing every part of the template, connecting your own domain, and publishing your site, so you're never stuck figuring things out on your own.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Click here to access \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Free Customization Tutorial\",\"marks\"