live on the Framer Marketplace!\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"After weeks of refining every detail, I'm excited to share \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Auton\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — a clean, modern portfolio template built for freelancers, designers, developers, creators, and anyone who wants a professional online presence without the hassle.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Rather than packing in unnecessary sections, I focused on creating a portfolio that's practical, intuitive, and genuinely useful for everyday use—making it easy to showcase your work while keeping the experience clean and professional.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"sparkles\",\"emoji\":\"✨\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Designed with simplicity in mind. \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"zap\",\"emoji\":\"⚡\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Built for performance. \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"iphone\",\"emoji\":\"📱\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Fully responsive. \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"dart\",\"emoji\":\"🎯\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Easy to customize. \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"briefcase\",\"emoji\":\"💼\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Crafted using modern portfolio best practices.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Whether you're showcasing your work, attracting clients, or building your personal brand, \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Auton\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" gives you a polished foundation that's ready to launch.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"ty