:\", Platform, Arpeggio, Rescale and Rebirth.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The current template value is \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"over $1000\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (with Extended Pro license including Figma files)\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"What’s included:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Remix links for all current templates\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Figma source files for all templates\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Unlimited domain usage (reuse on multiple domains)\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"50% discount for all future templates\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Lifetime Update \u0026 Priority Support\"}]}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Creative Portfolio Template\",\"slug\":\"rebirth\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"3b062a58-ca05-4acc-91a2-b82e96bd3a5d\",\"name\":\"Tamas Bodo\",\"slug\":\"tamas-bodo\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/834553/avatar-pOyurdbow2eub675g0t1S00I1a9ttk.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/47896/rebirth-Lzde6P4FO7N5aG0PpdeUI1d4DlNHJT\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/47896/rebirth-b63k2FLLTjkYuPQCZlvkOn6yqNEZUQ\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/47896/rebirth-IxabgMstyPtZ384uBJ67Urp9t32fvV\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/47896/rebirth-Lvg4VaB9kVKLJ6npGsmbiezPMopMuF\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 22%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01928aa2-7b50-7f8e-95be-c34ee6292118\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":604,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":12},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2024-10-01T19:38:24.116Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-26T12:11:36.538Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-10-14T10:45:57.200Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"template\",\"attributes\":{\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":\"https://framer.link/5dre7OP\",\"remixUrl\":\"https://framer.link/5dre7OP\",\"previewUrl\":\"https://re-birth.framer.website/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Agency\",\"slug\":\"agency\"},{\"id\":19,\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":14,\"name\":\"Landing Page\",\"slug\":\"landing-page\"},{\"id\":218,\"name\":\"Free\",\"slug\":\"free-website-templates\"}],\"styles\":[{\"id\":234,\"name\":\"Large Type\",\"slug\":\"large-type\"},{\"id\":247,\"name\":\"Professional\",\"slug\":\"professional\"},{\"id\":261,\"name\":\"Typographic\",\"slug\":\"typographic\"},{\"id\":110,\"name\":\"Animated\",\"slug\":\"animated\"}],\"mainCategory\":{\"id\":19,\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},\"features\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Appear Effects\",\"slug\":\"appear-effects\"},{\"id\":13,\"name\":\"Slideshows/Tickers\",\"slug\":\"slideshows-tickers\"},{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"Sticky Scrolling\",\"slug\":\"sticky-scrolling\"},{\"id\":18,\"name\":\"Scroll Effects\",\"slug\":\"scroll-effects\"},{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"CMS\",\"slug\":\"cms\"},{\"id\":23,\"name\":\"Rich Media\",\"slug\":\"rich-media\"},{\"id\":24,\"name\":\"Site Search\",\"slug\":\"site-search\"},{\"id\":25,\"name\":\"Custom Cursors\",\"slug\":\"custom-cursors\"},{\"id\":35,\"name\":\"Text Effects\",\"slug\":\"text-effects\"},{\"id\":37,\"name\":\"Code Components\",\"slug\":\"code-components\"},{\"id\":39,\"name\":\"Selection Styles\",\"slug\":\"selection-styles\"}]}},{\"id\":\"66407\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Stackgrid\",\"body\":\"$a5\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Stackgrid is a premium, enterprise-grade Framer template engineered specifically for AI infrastructure agencies, systems architects, and technical consultancies. If you sell custom LLM deployments, RAG architectures, or complex data pipelines, your website needs to project absolute technical authority.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Stackgrid strips away the generic, colorful corporate fluff. It utilizes a strict, high-contrast aesthetic, razor-sharp typography, and smooth, purpose-driven scroll animations to position your firm as an elite engineering cell.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Designed for conversion, every section is strategically structured to guide enterprise buyers from initial infrastructure audits to high-value SLA engagements.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Perfect For:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"AI Infrastructure Agencies\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Technical Consultancies \u0026 Systems Architects\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Data Engineering Firms\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"High-Ticket B2B Enterprise Services\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Boutique Software Development Cells\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Core Features:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Complete CMS Integration:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Effortlessly manage and publish complex Case Studies and Open Roles (Careers) without touching the canvas.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Premium Framer Motion:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Fluid, scroll-based scrubbing animations and interactions that feel like a high-end native application.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Conversion-Optimized Flow:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Strategically designed Service Tiers, Process Grids, and FAQ sections built specifically to sell phased engineering engagements.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"100% Responsive \u0026 Performant:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Pixel-perfect layouts that scale flawlessly across desktop, tablet, and mobile breakpoints.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Zero-Code Customization:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Built with Framer’s native components, colors \u0026 text styles for instant, seamless global theme updates.\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Pages Included:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Home (with Services, Process, and FAQ)\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"About (Company Manifesto \u0026 Team)\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Case Studies Index (CMS)\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Case Study (CMS)\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Careers Index (CMS)\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Careers (CMS)\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Contact (Lead Capture)\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"404 Custom Error Page\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Privacy Policy\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Terms \u0026 Conditions\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Acceptable Use\"}]}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"AI Agency Template\",\"slug\":\"stackgrid\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"ffcddbe5-39a0-46ce-966d-0d81e2e5a315\",\"name\":\"Krutik Maru\",\"slug\":\"krutikmaru\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/28785/avatar-Rqr0w4MougpWGZsM6BoWhI3TrypPUh.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"follow