. It helps you translate complex technologies into a compelling, system-driven interface with dynamic components and structured CMS collections. Your business is marketed as a premium through a combination of technical aesthetics, seamless micro-interactions, and fully responsive layouts. All you need to launch fast, look established, and scale efficiently in the AI era with QuantumFlux.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Some Core Features:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Fully Customizable\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" – Change colors, fonts, and assets in seconds to suit your needs.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Integrated CMS\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" – 2 CMS collections on board by default, customizable, and optimized for the AI project.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"100% Responsiv\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"e – Mobile, tablet, and desktop optimized pixel-perfect layouts.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Premium Animations\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" – Smooth, meaningful motion that demonstrates a high-quality digital product.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"All-in-One Structure\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" – Designed to match all AI Agency requirements perfectly.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"No-Code Executi