ich-media\"},{\"id\":25,\"name\":\"Custom Cursors\",\"slug\":\"custom-cursors\"},{\"id\":30,\"name\":\"Forms\",\"slug\":\"forms\"}]}},{\"id\":\"49578\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Porto\",\"body\":\"$b2\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Live Preview\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://porto-template.framer.website/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Porto is a remarkable minimal portfolio \u0026 agency template crafted to enhance your agency's or portfolio presentation. It’s an ideal portfolio solution for creative designers, freelancers, creative agencies, digital agencies, personal portfolios, minimal agencies, or anyone in the creative industry who wants to showcase their agency's or portfolio in a clean and sophisticated way. The minimal design keeps the focus entirely on agency's or portfolio's look, allowing the work to speak for itself.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Whether you're building your first agency/portfolio or looking to refresh your existing one, Porto offers the perfect balance of premium and elegance. Its portfolio-centric layout ensures that every project in your portfolio or agency stands out, free from unnecessary clutter. This template is designed for professionals who value the importance of a well-curated portfolio and agency, helping to make a lasting impression on clients and employers. If you're looking for a powerful and stylish way to present your portfolio or agency, Porto is the ideal choice to take your portfolio or agency to the next level.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"For anyone serious about their portfolio, Porto provides everything needed to create a striking portfolio or agency's that commands attention.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Dark Portfolio \